(4348886, 619543, 60173, '<td valign="top">Very, very pretty. It almost has a dark, Lord of the Rings feel. I think I would have liked to see a bit more saturation in the greens and reds. It''s still very beautiful though.<br/> <br/>It''s amazing that you captured the bridge with no people on it. Every time I''ve been to Multnomah Falls, it''s been packed. Especially with all the rain we''ve been getting and the obvious size of the falls this year. Maybe all the tourists were too wussy for all the rain... or maybe you just cloned them out, heh.</td>', 'Very, very pretty. It almost has a dark, Lord of the Rings feel. I think I would have liked to see a bit more saturation in the greens and reds. It''s still very beautiful though. It''s amazing that you captured the bridge with no people on it. Every time I''ve been to Multnomah Falls, it''s been packed. Especially with all the rain we''ve been getting and the obvious size of the falls this year. Maybe all the tourists were too wussy for all the rain... or maybe you just cloned them out, heh.', '2008-01-01 00:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
