(4350940, 626802, 88010, '<td valign="top">Looks more like " On Golden Pond", nice shot. I think it would have more impact as a landscape and not a portrait.</td>', 'Looks more like " On Golden Pond", nice shot. I think it would have more impact as a landscape and not a portrait.', '2008-01-01 18:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
