(4350947, 628009, 77543, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I''d just like to see the sun a little lower and perhaps less bright.</td>', 'Very nice - I''d just like to see the sun a little lower and perhaps less bright.', '2008-01-01 18:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350948, 626105, 88010, '<td valign="top">Yes they are, I wish that black blob wasn''t on the right top.</td>', 'Yes they are, I wish that black blob wasn''t on the right top.', '2008-01-01 18:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350952, 628012, 88010, '<td valign="top">OK, well that''s just weird. very harsh lighting, but maybe that was intended?</td>', 'OK, well that''s just weird. very harsh lighting, but maybe that was intended?', '2008-01-01 18:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350955, 624492, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice hands. very nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice hands. very nice lighting.', '2008-01-01 18:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350956, 624392, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d crop to remove the outside wall.</td>', 'I''d crop to remove the outside wall.', '2008-01-01 18:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350958, 627973, 88010, '<td valign="top">Under the bridge looks cold. Nice capture.</td>', 'Under the bridge looks cold. Nice capture.', '2008-01-01 18:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350961, 627631, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good contrast between the natural and man-made.</td>', 'Good contrast between the natural and man-made.', '2008-01-01 18:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350974, 627860, 70484, '<td valign="top">WOW!! I am not always a big fan of high key photos, but...WOW! Very nice and what a beautiful model! 10</td>', 'WOW!! I am not always a big fan of high key photos, but...WOW! Very nice and what a beautiful model! 10', '2008-01-01 18:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350995, 626335, 77543, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. There seems to be a lot of noise on the hand.</td>', 'Nice idea. There seems to be a lot of noise on the hand.', '2008-01-01 18:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350996, 627889, 77521, '<td valign="top">WOW. gorgeous shot! aww. i love little doxies! 10</td>', 'WOW. gorgeous shot! aww. i love little doxies! 10', '2008-01-01 18:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4350998, 627049, 77543, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see the whole bird for a change but it''s a bit dark.</td>', 'It''s nice to see the whole bird for a change but it''s a bit dark.', '2008-01-01 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351001, 626174, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tee hee - very cute. I like the use of black &amp; white. Hmmm, I can''t tell if its real or fake.</td>', 'Tee hee - very cute. I like the use of black & white. Hmmm, I can''t tell if its real or fake.', '2008-01-01 18:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351002, 627732, 77543, '<td valign="top">It seems very noisy.</td>', 'It seems very noisy.', '2008-01-01 18:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351005, 627914, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very pretty sky. I like the centered composition and the vertical format. Nice post-processing.</td>', 'Very pretty sky. I like the centered composition and the vertical format. Nice post-processing.', '2008-01-01 18:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351007, 625846, 77543, '<td valign="top">It would be much better if the subject was not obscuring the picture on the wall.</td>', 'It would be much better if the subject was not obscuring the picture on the wall.', '2008-01-01 18:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351009, 626489, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and colors. A bit too over processed for my personal taste, but still a great image. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and colors. A bit too over processed for my personal taste, but still a great image. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-01 18:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351012, 623428, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice view of the city. Great sunset colors...the white of the sun is a little hot,but still a nice image. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice view of the city. Great sunset colors...the white of the sun is a little hot,but still a nice image. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-01 18:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351015, 627984, 77543, '<td valign="top">If I was that close I''d suffer from camera shake, too.</td>', 'If I was that close I''d suffer from camera shake, too.', '2008-01-01 18:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351016, 627343, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. The flash is a little harsh, but nice composition.</td>', 'I like your idea. The flash is a little harsh, but nice composition.', '2008-01-01 18:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351018, 624522, 77543, '<td valign="top">There is not enough separation between the subject and background.</td>', 'There is not enough separation between the subject and background.', '2008-01-01 18:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351019, 627419, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the different colors on the building. Is it really like that or is it post-processing? I''ll be curious to find out. I like the contrast of the bright colors against the dark sky.</td>', 'I like the different colors on the building. Is it really like that or is it post-processing? I''ll be curious to find out. I like the contrast of the bright colors against the dark sky.', '2008-01-01 18:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351022, 627759, 41675, '<td valign="top">I wish this had been taking at a higher angle from you so I could see more of the horse - it''s beautiful. My favorite part is the light on its mane and face.</td>', 'I wish this had been taking at a higher angle from you so I could see more of the horse - it''s beautiful. My favorite part is the light on its mane and face.', '2008-01-01 18:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351024, 623797, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Awww, precious indeed. I like the use of black &amp; white - it works well on this image and keeps the background from being distracting.</td>', ':-) Awww, precious indeed. I like the use of black & white - it works well on this image and keeps the background from being distracting.', '2008-01-01 18:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351025, 627829, 77543, '<td valign="top">There is room to increase the contrast further and the picture is smaller than it could have been.  Otherwise great colours and use of slow shutter speed.</td>', 'There is room to increase the contrast further and the picture is smaller than it could have been.  Otherwise great colours and use of slow shutter speed.', '2008-01-01 18:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351032, 624387, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your image appears very grainy. I don''t know if thats intentional on your part or not though. For me, I would have preferred seeing his mouth and the water dish in focus as opposed to the top of the collar.</td>', 'Your image appears very grainy. I don''t know if thats intentional on your part or not though. For me, I would have preferred seeing his mouth and the water dish in focus as opposed to the top of the collar.', '2008-01-01 18:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351033, 627610, 77543, '<td valign="top">The sky has some great colours in it but is totally overshadowed by the out of focus building. An opportunity lost.</td>', 'The sky has some great colours in it but is totally overshadowed by the out of focus building. An opportunity lost.', '2008-01-01 18:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351036, 620405, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great colors on the cardinal! The soft blurred background gives me a feeling of cold and works well with the winter tree branches. Nice composition as well. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great colors on the cardinal! The soft blurred background gives me a feeling of cold and works well with the winter tree branches. Nice composition as well. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-01 18:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351039, 627789, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good sky and bridge but the foreground is too cluttered.</td>', 'Good sky and bridge but the foreground is too cluttered.', '2008-01-01 18:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351042, 621378, 77543, '<td valign="top">The blue on the right is a distraction.</td>', 'The blue on the right is a distraction.', '2008-01-01 18:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351044, 626311, 77543, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2008-01-01 18:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351045, 624764, 77543, '<td valign="top">The eye should be in focus.</td>', 'The eye should be in focus.', '2008-01-01 18:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351046, 627818, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to how this would look in sepia tone - if it would give it an even greater "old-time" feel? I like the composition. For me, I wish there was just a tad bit more light.</td>', 'I''m curious as to how this would look in sepia tone - if it would give it an even greater "old-time" feel? I like the composition. For me, I wish there was just a tad bit more light.', '2008-01-01 18:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351050, 627996, 77543, '<td valign="top">The sign should be more prominent in this picture. Overall the image looks very dark.</td>', 'The sign should be more prominent in this picture. Overall the image looks very dark.', '2008-01-01 18:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351053, 627333, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow! Cool shot - I like it. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow! Cool shot - I like it. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-01 18:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351054, 623396, 77543, '<td valign="top">It''s a decent silhouette but there''s not much of interest in this picture.</td>', 'It''s a decent silhouette but there''s not much of interest in this picture.', '2008-01-01 18:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4351057, 627750, 41675, '<td valign="top">This would make a great postcard or advertisement for the cruise line. Good colors and I like the bird on the right hand side.</td>', 'This would make a great postcard or advertisement for the cruise line. Good colors and I like the bird on the right hand side.', '2008-01-01 18:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
