(4352905, 627670, 77543, '<td valign="top">The line of the shadow is good. I''d like to see a bit more on the left.</td>', 'The line of the shadow is good. I''d like to see a bit more on the left.', '2008-01-02 06:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
