(4353097, 623247, 5354, '<td valign="top">I think this could well be Doc''s entry, if so I bow to you in the FS marathon. This is a wonderful image. Score 9/10 from me.<br/> <br/>If its not one of DrAchoo''s then please take this as a great compliment.</td>', 'I think this could well be Doc''s entry, if so I bow to you in the FS marathon. This is a wonderful image. Score 9/10 from me. If its not one of DrAchoo''s then please take this as a great compliment.', '2008-01-02 08:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353099, 624706, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool capture of the reflecting E.</td>', 'Cool capture of the reflecting E.', '2008-01-02 08:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353103, 627764, 60047, '<td valign="top">Priceless!</td>', 'Priceless!', '2008-01-02 08:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353104, 627534, 30982, '<td valign="top">A decent shot to show the size of these things - they really are larger than most people realize.  To me it seems a bit off balance with the large structure just to the left of center.  A bit more to the right of center might have better balance?  Overall the pictures seems to be just a bit on the underexposed or not quite contrasty enough side.</td>', 'A decent shot to show the size of these things - they really are larger than most people realize.  To me it seems a bit off balance with the large structure just to the left of center.  A bit more to the right of center might have better balance?  Overall the pictures seems to be just a bit on the underexposed or not quite contrasty enough side.', '2008-01-02 08:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353110, 624667, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh wow - posed more like a house cat.  How cool. I think since the crop is so narrow, I might''ve played with a wide black border on the sides to balance it out, but that''s just me.  Great shot.</td>', 'Oh wow - posed more like a house cat.  How cool. I think since the crop is so narrow, I might''ve played with a wide black border on the sides to balance it out, but that''s just me.  Great shot.', '2008-01-02 08:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353111, 627729, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good capture and very peaceful, but it does seem to be wanting a subject or focal point.</td>', 'A good capture and very peaceful, but it does seem to be wanting a subject or focal point.', '2008-01-02 08:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353114, 627093, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the barren feel of a single clump of trees.  Nice touch of duotone too.</td>', 'I love the barren feel of a single clump of trees.  Nice touch of duotone too.', '2008-01-02 08:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353117, 627508, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the lonely  almost skeleton feel of it but I might''ve not cropped off the top of the tree quite so tightly.</td>', 'I like the lonely  almost skeleton feel of it but I might''ve not cropped off the top of the tree quite so tightly.', '2008-01-02 08:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353119, 626335, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a great idea.  Love the use of negative space.  Neat idea for an album cover with the text to the left.  That hint of red and the shape of the bal is great.  The gold of the bracelet too.  NICE WORK.</td>', 'What a great idea.  Love the use of negative space.  Neat idea for an album cover with the text to the left.  That hint of red and the shape of the bal is great.  The gold of the bracelet too.  NICE WORK.', '2008-01-02 08:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353121, 625221, 15711, '<td valign="top">Funny, from the thumb, the water fountain looks like a woman in a white gown.  Hmmm - maybe it''s a poltergeist. ;~D  Good luck, Mate!!!! It''s a stunning shot.  The editing and comp - SPOT ON.</td>', 'Funny, from the thumb, the water fountain looks like a woman in a white gown.  Hmmm - maybe it''s a poltergeist. ;~D  Good luck, Mate!!!! It''s a stunning shot.  The editing and comp - SPOT ON.', '2008-01-02 08:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
