(4353719, 626644, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture. It''s one of my favorites while voting so far. Very strong and I love the composition, colour of light, etc. My only comment (more for future reference) is that it seems very over-sharpened on my monitor (which has medium contrast).  You may be using a monitor that has low contrast that doesn''t show the sharpening as much. Your image appears to already be pretty sharp so you probably don''t need to do as much sharpening. If you have photoshop, try the "unsharp" mask filter. Despite the name, it''s one of the more elegant sharpening tools.</td>', 'I really love this picture. It''s one of my favorites while voting so far. Very strong and I love the composition, colour of light, etc. My only comment (more for future reference) is that it seems very over-sharpened on my monitor (which has medium contrast).  You may be using a monitor that has low contrast that doesn''t show the sharpening as much. Your image appears to already be pretty sharp so you probably don''t need to do as much sharpening. If you have photoshop, try the "unsharp" mask filter. Despite the name, it''s one of the more elegant sharpening tools.', '2008-01-02 11:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4353783, 624382, 24974, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, almost like a postcard image but the effects applied in post are a little too strong for my taste.</td>', 'Pretty scene, almost like a postcard image but the effects applied in post are a little too strong for my taste.', '2008-01-02 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
