(4353792, 624387, 81530, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the title suits the photograph. The dogs face and his water bowl are out of focus and therefore the viewers gaze is fixed on his collar. The collar is the focal point because it is <i>the only thing</i> in focus.</td>', 'I don''t think the title suits the photograph. The dogs face and his water bowl are out of focus and therefore the viewers gaze is fixed on his collar. The collar is the focal point because it is the only thing in focus.', '2008-01-02 12:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
