(4354452, 627973, 60047, '<td valign="top">The orange is almost surreal. The blue of the bridge is wonderfully complimentary. Interesting composition and crop choice you have made, here. Great shot.</td>', 'The orange is almost surreal. The blue of the bridge is wonderfully complimentary. Interesting composition and crop choice you have made, here. Great shot.', '2008-01-02 15:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
