(4354486, 622974, 60047, '<td valign="top">I''ve noticed that political statements have a hard time doing well at DPC. I think you have some voters that can''t get beyond the political message and see the photo with a photographer''s technical eye. The composition of this photo is pretty cluttered and the lack of contrast hurts this B &amp; W. The focus isn''t very sharp, either.</td>', 'I''ve noticed that political statements have a hard time doing well at DPC. I think you have some voters that can''t get beyond the political message and see the photo with a photographer''s technical eye. The composition of this photo is pretty cluttered and the lack of contrast hurts this B & W. The focus isn''t very sharp, either.', '2008-01-02 15:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4354489, 624770, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice. Sometimes I think we do have too many power lines in our world... but still nice photo, nice colors and composition :)</td>', 'Nice. Sometimes I think we do have too many power lines in our world... but still nice photo, nice colors and composition :)', '2008-01-02 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
