(4354523, 627695, 24974, '<td valign="top">Looks like someone drug a body up there.  ;-) Very pretty shot.</td>', 'Looks like someone drug a body up there.  ;-) Very pretty shot.', '2008-01-02 15:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
