(4355053, 624888, 82534, '<td valign="top">A stunning use of color and contrast. My only wish is that the faces were a darker.  But that''s just a minor quibble!</td>', 'A stunning use of color and contrast. My only wish is that the faces were a darker.  But that''s just a minor quibble!', '2008-01-02 18:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355055, 628010, 85886, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot...I''m a sucker for light streamers but this one has the additional starry sky for amazing context.  It''s such a wide shot that the fisheye effect I think in this case detracts a little - am just wondering if maybe a debarrelize on it might have helped.  I can totally understand leaving it as is because it does create additional drama in an ''otherwordly'' shot.  Great shot either way...grats!  10 and a fave.</td>', 'Brilliant shot...I''m a sucker for light streamers but this one has the additional starry sky for amazing context.  It''s such a wide shot that the fisheye effect I think in this case detracts a little - am just wondering if maybe a debarrelize on it might have helped.  I can totally understand leaving it as is because it does create additional drama in an ''otherwordly'' shot.  Great shot either way...grats!  10 and a fave.', '2008-01-02 18:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355057, 623485, 82534, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity of the stars in this photo.  It really adds visual interest to the top half of the photo and makes it stand out as unique.</td>', 'I love the clarity of the stars in this photo.  It really adds visual interest to the top half of the photo and makes it stand out as unique.', '2008-01-02 18:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
