(4355061, 627993, 85886, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!  I love the clarity and contrast in this shot.  Shame the sky wasn''t any more interesting on the day but nonetheless a fabulous shot.</td>', 'Breathtaking!  I love the clarity and contrast in this shot.  Shame the sky wasn''t any more interesting on the day but nonetheless a fabulous shot.', '2008-01-02 18:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
