(4355074, 627713, 85886, '<td valign="top">Lovely viewpoint but it might have worked a bit better to use a longer exposure to get a mistier water.</td>', 'Lovely viewpoint but it might have worked a bit better to use a longer exposure to get a mistier water.', '2008-01-02 18:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
