(4355093, 626257, 85886, '<td valign="top">Velvia was way more saturated than this :)  Nice composition but not sharp enough for me, for this kind of a shot.</td>', 'Velvia was way more saturated than this :)  Nice composition but not sharp enough for me, for this kind of a shot.', '2008-01-02 19:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355099, 625221, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the way you''ve brought out the colour but left a dark gothic feel about it, perfect for the church.  One of those photos that could feel over processed but doesn''t, despite the HDR feel.  Great shot - passes the ''I''d hang this on my wall'' test :)</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the way you''ve brought out the colour but left a dark gothic feel about it, perfect for the church.  One of those photos that could feel over processed but doesn''t, despite the HDR feel.  Great shot - passes the ''I''d hang this on my wall'' test :)', '2008-01-02 19:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355102, 627996, 32872, '<td valign="top">lol!!!!  Brilliant title and image!  I love your detail and fabulous lighting, not to mention your sense of humor!! This has to be one of the funniest things I''ve seen in a long time.  Are those old signs piled-up? I''m putting this into my favs.  Thanks for the good natured laugh.</td>', 'lol!!!!  Brilliant title and image!  I love your detail and fabulous lighting, not to mention your sense of humor!! This has to be one of the funniest things I''ve seen in a long time.  Are those old signs piled-up? I''m putting this into my favs.  Thanks for the good natured laugh.', '2008-01-02 19:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355104, 626623, 32872, '<td valign="top">ohhhh, this is so very cool!!  I love the abstract, ghostly quality about your image.  It''s so artistic.</td>', 'ohhhh, this is so very cool!!  I love the abstract, ghostly quality about your image.  It''s so artistic.', '2008-01-02 19:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355105, 628000, 85886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - the colours and layers are gorgeous.  Couple of things though - the barbed wire in the foreground is distracting (I can imagine you were trying everything to shoot over it and still keep the road) and some of the colours are a bit washed out and may benefit from some boosting.</td>', 'Beautiful shot - the colours and layers are gorgeous.  Couple of things though - the barbed wire in the foreground is distracting (I can imagine you were trying everything to shoot over it and still keep the road) and some of the colours are a bit washed out and may benefit from some boosting.', '2008-01-02 19:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355116, 627654, 85886, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot that I think is just let down by the skewed levelling.  I think you could probably afford to rotate this image to level it off and not lose anything significant from  it.</td>', 'Amazing shot that I think is just let down by the skewed levelling.  I think you could probably afford to rotate this image to level it off and not lose anything significant from  it.', '2008-01-02 19:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355118, 620980, 85886, '<td valign="top">This is just too dark - if I hadn''t read the title I wouldn''t have known what this shot was!</td>', 'This is just too dark - if I hadn''t read the title I wouldn''t have known what this shot was!', '2008-01-02 19:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355120, 625647, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition. You could process the heck out of this image with huge success you know!  One thing everyone will be griping about is the fact you failed to straighten the water line on the horizon, so it appears your water is sliding off the lefthand side of your image.  Keep up your good work though..this is very nice!! Oh yeah, one more thing to help you out a bit...spelling can be an issue in titles. sorry to nitpick</td>', 'Nice colors and composition. You could process the heck out of this image with huge success you know!  One thing everyone will be griping about is the fact you failed to straighten the water line on the horizon, so it appears your water is sliding off the lefthand side of your image.  Keep up your good work though..this is very nice!! Oh yeah, one more thing to help you out a bit...spelling can be an issue in titles. sorry to nitpick', '2008-01-02 19:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355125, 626956, 32872, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose and lighting..nice capture.  Love the detail and amazing color and patterns.</td>', 'Beautiful pose and lighting..nice capture.  Love the detail and amazing color and patterns.', '2008-01-02 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355128, 622553, 85886, '<td valign="top">Beautifully moody - I adore this shot.  Won''t be to the taste of many of the DPC voters because it''s dark and broody but to me it''s fantastically evocative shot with subtle lighting and colours.  It looks like a classical painting - well done (and if you''re going for popular shots, unlucky!! :))</td>', 'Beautifully moody - I adore this shot.  Won''t be to the taste of many of the DPC voters because it''s dark and broody but to me it''s fantastically evocative shot with subtle lighting and colours.  It looks like a classical painting - well done (and if you''re going for popular shots, unlucky!! :))', '2008-01-02 19:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355132, 627115, 32872, '<td valign="top">So beautiful and hauntingly stark.</td>', 'So beautiful and hauntingly stark.', '2008-01-02 19:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355136, 622254, 85886, '<td valign="top">800mm with 2x extender eh? (joke!)  Beautiful...once this challenge is over I need to pick your brains on astrophotography....</td>', '800mm with 2x extender eh? (joke!)  Beautiful...once this challenge is over I need to pick your brains on astrophotography....', '2008-01-02 19:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
