(4355145, 619349, 85886, '<td valign="top">Needs better focus - you lead the viewer''s eye to the model but then when you get there the eye and face is out of focus, which lets this photograph down imho.</td>', 'Needs better focus - you lead the viewer''s eye to the model but then when you get there the eye and face is out of focus, which lets this photograph down imho.', '2008-01-02 19:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
