(4355153, 627439, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great shot - obviously brilliant patterns and texture, but also perfect DoF and nice muted colours.  If I''m being nitpicky I''d prefer the tops of the cliffs to be a little underexposed to save a touch of highlight.</td>', 'Great shot - obviously brilliant patterns and texture, but also perfect DoF and nice muted colours.  If I''m being nitpicky I''d prefer the tops of the cliffs to be a little underexposed to save a touch of highlight.', '2008-01-02 19:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355163, 627345, 85886, '<td valign="top">The flow and texture of the water is lovely but it''s not enough for a shot like this imho.  You''ve got lovely greens and browns in the surrounding/framing rocks there that under advanced editing you could really bring out to compliment the milky water.</td>', 'The flow and texture of the water is lovely but it''s not enough for a shot like this imho.  You''ve got lovely greens and browns in the surrounding/framing rocks there that under advanced editing you could really bring out to compliment the milky water.', '2008-01-02 19:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
