(4355756, 626483, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of has an old-film look to it. The slightly off center left to right framing works good. The sky appears overcast, not a lot of interest up there. I think cropping another 15-20% off the top would have helped the comp a little.</td>', 'Kind of has an old-film look to it. The slightly off center left to right framing works good. The sky appears overcast, not a lot of interest up there. I think cropping another 15-20% off the top would have helped the comp a little.', '2008-01-02 22:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355768, 624522, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the effort here, though the vignetting strikes me as a touch too strong at the edges. The background on the right seems distracting from the rest of the image as well. The horse looks awesome, a proud and mighty beast.</td>', 'I like the effort here, though the vignetting strikes me as a touch too strong at the edges. The background on the right seems distracting from the rest of the image as well. The horse looks awesome, a proud and mighty beast.', '2008-01-02 22:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355769, 627862, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good comp, and I like the appearance of the evening light coming through the leaves.</td>', 'Good comp, and I like the appearance of the evening light coming through the leaves.', '2008-01-02 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355771, 624667, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like he was posing for you. How long did you have to wait for this shot?</td>', 'Looks like he was posing for you. How long did you have to wait for this shot?', '2008-01-02 22:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355776, 628012, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s got to be some pun here that I am not getting.</td>', 'There''s got to be some pun here that I am not getting.', '2008-01-02 22:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355777, 625273, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good enough, it just does not grab my attention.</td>', 'Good enough, it just does not grab my attention.', '2008-01-02 22:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355784, 627724, 83313, '<td valign="top">A really cool catch of this. too bad challenge rules don''t allow you to add some  wings to him! The field above his head is a little distracting, but you could not exactly pose this shot!</td>', 'A really cool catch of this. too bad challenge rules don''t allow you to add some  wings to him! The field above his head is a little distracting, but you could not exactly pose this shot!', '2008-01-02 22:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355785, 627602, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awwww... Adorable big eyes.</td>', 'Awwww... Adorable big eyes.', '2008-01-02 22:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355791, 627966, 83313, '<td valign="top">A fun view. Unfortunately, the post on the left is what is most in focus.</td>', 'A fun view. Unfortunately, the post on the left is what is most in focus.', '2008-01-02 22:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355792, 627912, 83313, '<td valign="top">A proud animal. A touch more boost to the contrast and colors would give this some more oomph, but it''s still good.</td>', 'A proud animal. A touch more boost to the contrast and colors would give this some more oomph, but it''s still good.', '2008-01-02 22:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355798, 627995, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for big beautiful eyes. Seems to be a touch of a yellow color cast, though. DOF is kind of shallow, putting the bridge of her nose out of focus.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for big beautiful eyes. Seems to be a touch of a yellow color cast, though. DOF is kind of shallow, putting the bridge of her nose out of focus.', '2008-01-02 22:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355800, 626877, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice clear and detailed view. Not too much you can do with it though, unless you catch an object in front of it, or frame it somehow.</td>', 'A nice clear and detailed view. Not too much you can do with it though, unless you catch an object in front of it, or frame it somehow.', '2008-01-02 22:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355803, 627473, 71244, '<td valign="top">too cute. lovely image.</td>', 'too cute. lovely image.', '2008-01-02 22:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355805, 624780, 56880, '<td valign="top">Sitting at the edge of the yard, watching the sun set and reflecting on their own last hours.  Great choice for perspective and saturation.  That you, NikonJeb?</td>', 'Sitting at the edge of the yard, watching the sun set and reflecting on their own last hours.  Great choice for perspective and saturation.  That you, NikonJeb?', '2008-01-02 22:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355813, 627088, 83313, '<td valign="top">Took me a bit of looking to get the pun. I saw the UPS store right away, but did not immediately notice the down arrow. There''s really too much going on here, without a central subject or much to lead my eye anywhere in particular. If not for the title I would have thought the subject was the fried chicken shop.</td>', 'Took me a bit of looking to get the pun. I saw the UPS store right away, but did not immediately notice the down arrow. There''s really too much going on here, without a central subject or much to lead my eye anywhere in particular. If not for the title I would have thought the subject was the fried chicken shop.', '2008-01-02 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355816, 625904, 56880, '<td valign="top">Faces and memories blurring as time uncompromisingly moves on..  The distance between the two exaggerated by the DOF; her own face is clear for now, though even her wedding ring is losing its history.<br/> <br/>I love pictures that tell compelling stories.  It''ll be a crime if this doesn''t land in the top 25%.</td>', 'Faces and memories blurring as time uncompromisingly moves on..  The distance between the two exaggerated by the DOF; her own face is clear for now, though even her wedding ring is losing its history. I love pictures that tell compelling stories.  It''ll be a crime if this doesn''t land in the top 25%.', '2008-01-02 23:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355817, 627766, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good photo, I like the water ripples, but the birds pose does not grab me.</td>', 'A good photo, I like the water ripples, but the birds pose does not grab me.', '2008-01-02 23:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355819, 626327, 71244, '<td valign="top">i absolutely love this image. beautiful.</td>', 'i absolutely love this image. beautiful.', '2008-01-02 23:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355829, 627093, 56880, '<td valign="top">I had to take a second, third, and even fourth long look at this.  The initial centering of the subject made me balk at first, but the detail of the snow weighing down the branches, scrubs trying to poke through the blanket on the ground, and the fence in the background kept bringing me back.  The detail of the branches isolates the tree nicely against the soft sky.</td>', 'I had to take a second, third, and even fourth long look at this.  The initial centering of the subject made me balk at first, but the detail of the snow weighing down the branches, scrubs trying to poke through the blanket on the ground, and the fence in the background kept bringing me back.  The detail of the branches isolates the tree nicely against the soft sky.', '2008-01-02 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355836, 619996, 16531, '<td valign="top">I think I know that Tree is this in  Niagara Falls?</td>', 'I think I know that Tree is this in  Niagara Falls?', '2008-01-02 23:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355986, 626265, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love this place. Nice shot of the American Falls</td>', 'I love this place. Nice shot of the American Falls', '2008-01-02 23:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355988, 627503, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, Looks like a painting.</td>', 'Nice tones, Looks like a painting.', '2008-01-02 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355996, 627234, 33672, '<td valign="top">Must be near an airport. Nice tones and capture.</td>', 'Must be near an airport. Nice tones and capture.', '2008-01-02 23:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356000, 627934, 39110, '<td valign="top">This is a magnificent image but I am not keen on the sepia tonings though</td>', 'This is a magnificent image but I am not keen on the sepia tonings though', '2008-01-03 00:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356152, 626489, 15711, '<td valign="top">The flies really puts this over the edge for me. NICE work</td>', 'The flies really puts this over the edge for me. NICE work', '2008-01-03 00:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356156, 627818, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would be so cool in HDR!!!</td>', 'This would be so cool in HDR!!!', '2008-01-03 00:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356159, 626092, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very vintage, the noise and the fog give this so much mystery</td>', 'Very vintage, the noise and the fog give this so much mystery', '2008-01-03 00:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356160, 627101, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice softness.  The line and muted tones suit it well.</td>', 'Nice softness.  The line and muted tones suit it well.', '2008-01-03 00:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356164, 626721, 70000, '<td valign="top">The texture in whatever it is you put be original on is really really great. I love the lighting and the slight vignette all just works very well. I know several people who would love this on their wall</td>', 'The texture in whatever it is you put be original on is really really great. I love the lighting and the slight vignette all just works very well. I know several people who would love this on their wall', '2008-01-03 01:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356166, 628000, 15711, '<td valign="top">Every color of the palette!!  Very painterly.</td>', 'Every color of the palette!!  Very painterly.', '2008-01-03 01:00:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4356168, 627240, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  It has a somber lonely feel to it.</td>', 'Nice composition.  It has a somber lonely feel to it.', '2008-01-03 01:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356175, 621981, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and focus on her eyes. I think I would have cropped it right at the end of the tendril of hair. Might not be a traditional size, but so much white and the smocking on the blouse, is a touch distracting to me. ;~D</td>', 'Nice lighting and focus on her eyes. I think I would have cropped it right at the end of the tendril of hair. Might not be a traditional size, but so much white and the smocking on the blouse, is a touch distracting to me. ;~D', '2008-01-03 01:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356176, 620561, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  - what a funny title.</td>', 'ROFL  - what a funny title.', '2008-01-03 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356177, 627699, 15711, '<td valign="top">Ooh how pretty.  I''m curious what in the heck that is.  I love the abstractness. 7</td>', 'Ooh how pretty.  I''m curious what in the heck that is.  I love the abstractness. 7', '2008-01-03 01:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356184, 627704, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast and mood.</td>', 'Love the contrast and mood.', '2008-01-03 01:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356195, 623542, 58785, '<td valign="top">I think this is an ideal place for photography. Here is what I would do. Wait for the sun, and get a bit closer. It seems right now a bit depressing :/</td>', 'I think this is an ideal place for photography. Here is what I would do. Wait for the sun, and get a bit closer. It seems right now a bit depressing :/', '2008-01-03 01:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356196, 620358, 25155, '<td valign="top">Love your style! That white line is insanely straight.</td>', 'Love your style! That white line is insanely straight.', '2008-01-03 01:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356198, 624634, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice capturing the snow. I like the BW work, and simplicity.</td>', 'Nice capturing the snow. I like the BW work, and simplicity.', '2008-01-03 01:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356202, 623109, 58785, '<td valign="top">More than cold, gives me warm feeling because of the steam coming out of the water. Skewed horizon and a bit dark photo for my taste :/</td>', 'More than cold, gives me warm feeling because of the steam coming out of the water. Skewed horizon and a bit dark photo for my taste :/', '2008-01-03 01:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356204, 628008, 58785, '<td valign="top">Those guys never get old. Always look nice, and glory :) This one looks like seasoned a bit more. I like the way faders open a bit like different hair style :D</td>', 'Those guys never get old. Always look nice, and glory :) This one looks like seasoned a bit more. I like the way faders open a bit like different hair style :D', '2008-01-03 01:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356205, 628010, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good sharp colors and sky.</td>', 'Nice. Good sharp colors and sky.', '2008-01-03 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4356206, 627789, 58785, '<td valign="top">Simple and very nice colored bridge scenery. I like the reflection, gives me a paint feeling more than a photo :)</td>', 'Simple and very nice colored bridge scenery. I like the reflection, gives me a paint feeling more than a photo :)', '2008-01-03 01:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
