(4357071, 624506, 58785, '<td valign="top">Subject line says more than picture itself. Dark side, and too narrow dof, or didn''t focus to right spot :/ I am sure you''ll do better next time... whoever you are :D</td>', 'Subject line says more than picture itself. Dark side, and too narrow dof, or didn''t focus to right spot :/ I am sure you''ll do better next time... whoever you are :D', '2008-01-03 10:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357076, 627748, 58785, '<td valign="top">Ah... Santa for 2008! They grow fast don''t they :P Very nice baby portrait. i think my only concern here is the focusing. If those eyes would be shiny as glass, and bit less light, and a bit darker framing around... I can see it, much better points :)</td>', 'Ah... Santa for 2008! They grow fast don''t they :P Very nice baby portrait. i think my only concern here is the focusing. If those eyes would be shiny as glass, and bit less light, and a bit darker framing around... I can see it, much better points :)', '2008-01-03 10:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357078, 626415, 58785, '<td valign="top">Those guys are intelligent I tell ya. and very cute too. This is a good sample of a Chick with very nice matching colors :)</td>', 'Those guys are intelligent I tell ya. and very cute too. This is a good sample of a Chick with very nice matching colors :)', '2008-01-03 10:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
