(4357196, 625502, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice... I am not sure about the fences and tire prints up front. Distracting from a great aurora view with very nice mountain tops there. Maybe I would crop it a bit more :P</td>', 'Nice... I am not sure about the fences and tire prints up front. Distracting from a great aurora view with very nice mountain tops there. Maybe I would crop it a bit more :P', '2008-01-03 11:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357199, 623358, 58785, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective. I like the rock and clouds, but a bit silent photo for me. Could be enhanced a bit more ?</td>', 'Cool perspective. I like the rock and clouds, but a bit silent photo for me. Could be enhanced a bit more ?', '2008-01-03 11:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357202, 626544, 58785, '<td valign="top">nice perspective. I like BW work. Good photo overall ;)</td>', 'nice perspective. I like BW work. Good photo overall ;)', '2008-01-03 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357207, 624947, 85886, '<td valign="top">Unreal colours!  Love it - great shot with lovely sharpness in the rocks contrasted with the milky water.  There''s something in the way of the bridge that I can''t work out, but there''s nothing you could do about it.  I hope this one ribbons because it''s magical.</td>', 'Unreal colours!  Love it - great shot with lovely sharpness in the rocks contrasted with the milky water.  There''s something in the way of the bridge that I can''t work out, but there''s nothing you could do about it.  I hope this one ribbons because it''s magical.', '2008-01-03 11:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357208, 627752, 85886, '<td valign="top">Beautifully elegant shot.  The black and white tones are perfect - plenty of detail and subtle.  I think I''d have been tempted to go hard contrast and ruin it.  Congratulations.  This would look brilliant on anyone''s wall.  Perhaps a minor crop on the right hand to bring the tree closer to the 1/3rd line?</td>', 'Beautifully elegant shot.  The black and white tones are perfect - plenty of detail and subtle.  I think I''d have been tempted to go hard contrast and ruin it.  Congratulations.  This would look brilliant on anyone''s wall.  Perhaps a minor crop on the right hand to bring the tree closer to the 1/3rd line?', '2008-01-03 11:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357213, 627051, 85886, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing!  The additional gull in the foreground is a real bonus too.  The lighting, the expression and particularly the lighting through the great posture of the bird in flight are all fantastic.  Great shot.</td>', 'Perfect timing!  The additional gull in the foreground is a real bonus too.  The lighting, the expression and particularly the lighting through the great posture of the bird in flight are all fantastic.  Great shot.', '2008-01-03 11:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357224, 627101, 85886, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful shot - for me because of the layering and the elegant simplicity of the composition, especially the soft almost pastel colours.  The twinkling of the lighthouse is the cherry on the top though and really makes the photo.  The post processing gives me a painted/classic feel to it.  Even the blown out highlights of the water makes a beautiful contrast with the moody skies above.  Great stuff.</td>', 'Such a beautiful shot - for me because of the layering and the elegant simplicity of the composition, especially the soft almost pastel colours.  The twinkling of the lighthouse is the cherry on the top though and really makes the photo.  The post processing gives me a painted/classic feel to it.  Even the blown out highlights of the water makes a beautiful contrast with the moody skies above.  Great stuff.', '2008-01-03 11:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357234, 625896, 85886, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!!  Her expression is great - so much better than a typical smile.  I just love the tones in this shot, perfect to show the details of this lovely woman.  I particularly love her 50s (?) style glasses which just add to the ''retro'' feel of this image, and the lightness of her shirt which provides a lovely contrast with her face.  Just brilliant.</td>', 'Gorgeous!!  Her expression is great - so much better than a typical smile.  I just love the tones in this shot, perfect to show the details of this lovely woman.  I particularly love her 50s (?) style glasses which just add to the ''retro'' feel of this image, and the lightness of her shirt which provides a lovely contrast with her face.  Just brilliant.', '2008-01-03 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357252, 620358, 85886, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully original image and beautifully executed.</td>', 'A wonderfully original image and beautifully executed.', '2008-01-03 11:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
