(4359011, 627970, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice golden glow, the clouds appear embossed on the sky. Unfortunately, nice sunsets are easy to find, and to me, this does not stand out from the pack. <br/> <br/>You need to watch your compression settings, as well. There are visible compression artifacts around the dark cloud, and the file size of 38k shows why. You had another 112k to use. You probably also lost some detail elsewhere in the shot due to that.</td>', 'Nice golden glow, the clouds appear embossed on the sky. Unfortunately, nice sunsets are easy to find, and to me, this does not stand out from the pack.  You need to watch your compression settings, as well. There are visible compression artifacts around the dark cloud, and the file size of 38k shows why. You had another 112k to use. You probably also lost some detail elsewhere in the shot due to that.', '2008-01-03 22:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
