(4360641, 628000, 39427, '<td valign="top">i like where you''re going with this but feel that the crop is too tight on the bottom... i don''t like how the road hugs the frame like that, but i''m not sure theres much you could have done about that.  <br/> <br/>Also, I think some dodging and burning could have really accentuated the really interesting parts of your image like the red leaves in the bottom left, the road, and the sunlit hill top.  And overall i think the image could use a bit more contrast through levels or curves.<br/> <br/>Sorry for the long post but i really like the pic, thats the only reason i wanted to comment :) 7</td>', 'i like where you''re going with this but feel that the crop is too tight on the bottom... i don''t like how the road hugs the frame like that, but i''m not sure theres much you could have done about that.   Also, I think some dodging and burning could have really accentuated the really interesting parts of your image like the red leaves in the bottom left, the road, and the sunlit hill top.  And overall i think the image could use a bit more contrast through levels or curves. Sorry for the long post but i really like the pic, thats the only reason i wanted to comment :) 7', '2008-01-04 15:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
