(4361902, 626251, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry of your composition. Too bad the sky is so washed out, but otherwise I like it.</td>', 'I like the symmetry of your composition. Too bad the sky is so washed out, but otherwise I like it.', '2008-01-04 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
