(4361919, 627765, 41675, '<td valign="top">She looks very sweet. Had her face been upturned a bit more, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'She looks very sweet. Had her face been upturned a bit more, I would have scored it higher.', '2008-01-04 22:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4361925, 626056, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great eyes! Very sweet photo. Had the hat been back just a bit more so more of the eye was visible, I would have scored it higher. I also notice the blurred white area behind her, which is a little distracting. Overall though, I think it''s a cute photo and the border works well.</td>', 'Great eyes! Very sweet photo. Had the hat been back just a bit more so more of the eye was visible, I would have scored it higher. I also notice the blurred white area behind her, which is a little distracting. Overall though, I think it''s a cute photo and the border works well.', '2008-01-04 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4361933, 627250, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice snowfall shot. I feel as if I can almost hear Christmas carolers in the background :-) I find if I use my hand to block out the two partial flags on the left side, I like your image even better.</td>', 'Nice snowfall shot. I feel as if I can almost hear Christmas carolers in the background :-) I find if I use my hand to block out the two partial flags on the left side, I like your image even better.', '2008-01-04 22:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
