(4361945, 627164, 41675, '<td valign="top">The more I look at your image, the more I like it. The lights on the house, really help set off the overall darkness of the rest of the image - gives it a good balance. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The more I look at your image, the more I like it. The lights on the house, really help set off the overall darkness of the rest of the image - gives it a good balance. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-04 22:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
