(4361955, 626705, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first impression when your image popped up was that it reminded me of a painting from the "old masters." (DaVinci, Michaelangelo, etc.) I really like the texture of the veil (and I''m usually not a fan of veil shots). Excellent lighting and composition as well. Definitely in my top three for this free study challenge. Good luck. 10</td>', 'My first impression when your image popped up was that it reminded me of a painting from the "old masters." (DaVinci, Michaelangelo, etc.) I really like the texture of the veil (and I''m usually not a fan of veil shots). Excellent lighting and composition as well. Definitely in my top three for this free study challenge. Good luck. 10', '2008-01-04 23:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
