(4363038, 626113, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice image/scene.  The composition seems <i>slightly</i> off balance, but could just be a visual/perspective thing.  Like the shadow over the snow.  Up to 7 from 6.  Wish the darker area in the sky top right (and a little on the cabin, only to see more detail) could have been ''rescued''.  And to really nit-pick, a more refined crop, especially at the bottom.  Looks like a very nice place to hide away from the world - but only if there is a fireplace.</td>', 'Nice image/scene.  The composition seems slightly off balance, but could just be a visual/perspective thing.  Like the shadow over the snow.  Up to 7 from 6.  Wish the darker area in the sky top right (and a little on the cabin, only to see more detail) could have been ''rescued''.  And to really nit-pick, a more refined crop, especially at the bottom.  Looks like a very nice place to hide away from the world - but only if there is a fireplace.', '2008-01-05 11:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363049, 627689, 39850, '<td valign="top">The outfit fits well - perhaps taking the time to set up a shot may have produced a stronger image, as is it looks like a bit of a ''snap''.</td>', 'The outfit fits well - perhaps taking the time to set up a shot may have produced a stronger image, as is it looks like a bit of a ''snap''.', '2008-01-05 11:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
