(4363982, 628015, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the scene.  Wonder whether a more refined crop, especially on the left, may have made this even stronger.  Fairly minor, but looks like it needs a slight rotation up on the right to straighten.  Nice sky behind, including color.  Be nice to be able to see the detail in the stained glass windows more, but as is, perhaps a toning or b&amp;w may have given it something extra, but your call, of course.  This image was my 40,000th vote at DPC.</td>', '5 - Like the scene.  Wonder whether a more refined crop, especially on the left, may have made this even stronger.  Fairly minor, but looks like it needs a slight rotation up on the right to straighten.  Nice sky behind, including color.  Be nice to be able to see the detail in the stained glass windows more, but as is, perhaps a toning or b&w may have given it something extra, but your call, of course.  This image was my 40,000th vote at DPC.', '2008-01-05 18:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363984, 628002, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your image is very busy and my eyes wander all over without any real focal point. Good concept though. Perhaps if it were cropped into a horizontal image and cutting out the botttom bird it would put the focus on the two birds at top.</td>', 'For me, your image is very busy and my eyes wander all over without any real focal point. Good concept though. Perhaps if it were cropped into a horizontal image and cutting out the botttom bird it would put the focus on the two birds at top.', '2008-01-05 18:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
