(4365508, 627996, 41675, '<td valign="top">Because it''s so bright compared to the rest of your image,my eyes are consistently drawn to the house itself. This makes me see it as the focal point. Then I read your title and it doesn''t quite work with the way you have your image composed. Also, be careful about darkening the corners too much, it too can be distracting.</td>', 'Because it''s so bright compared to the rest of your image,my eyes are consistently drawn to the house itself. This makes me see it as the focal point. Then I read your title and it doesn''t quite work with the way you have your image composed. Also, be careful about darkening the corners too much, it too can be distracting.', '2008-01-06 09:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4365511, 627086, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the color bands of the sunrise are so even it almost looks fake in a way. My favorite part of your photo is the upper half with the tree and the moon.</td>', 'For me, the color bands of the sunrise are so even it almost looks fake in a way. My favorite part of your photo is the upper half with the tree and the moon.', '2008-01-06 09:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4365514, 625276, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice winter scene. Good lighting and composition. I like how the eye is lead into the fenced area. Good sky too.</td>', 'Very nice winter scene. Good lighting and composition. I like how the eye is lead into the fenced area. Good sky too.', '2008-01-06 09:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4365516, 628008, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice eagle portrait. Good lighting on the beak and details on the feathers.</td>', 'Very nice eagle portrait. Good lighting on the beak and details on the feathers.', '2008-01-06 09:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4365519, 628012, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well, your image made me laugh. Definitely unique. I''m not crazy about the overly thick border on either side. For me, I would like to see a bit more color saturation, it seems a little flat.</td>', 'Well, your image made me laugh. Definitely unique. I''m not crazy about the overly thick border on either side. For me, I would like to see a bit more color saturation, it seems a little flat.', '2008-01-06 09:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4365524, 624408, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and the composition. The glare spot detracts a bit for me, but I like the colors on the horizon.</td>', 'I like your idea and the composition. The glare spot detracts a bit for me, but I like the colors on the horizon.', '2008-01-06 09:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4365527, 624550, 41675, '<td valign="top">Eww! I''m really not a bug fan, they creep me out, but it''s a good macro.</td>', 'Eww! I''m really not a bug fan, they creep me out, but it''s a good macro.', '2008-01-06 09:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4365531, 627862, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the tress for framing the bird house. Good lighting. I do wonder how this would look if you moved in a bit closer.</td>', 'I like how you used the tress for framing the bird house. Good lighting. I do wonder how this would look if you moved in a bit closer.', '2008-01-06 09:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4365534, 627897, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very strong contrast between bridge and trees, almost too much for me in some ways. That''s all my eyes focus on - the bridge and they ignore the rest of your photo.</td>', 'Very strong contrast between bridge and trees, almost too much for me in some ways. That''s all my eyes focus on - the bridge and they ignore the rest of your photo.', '2008-01-06 09:52:40.000000', NULL, 1);
