(4365608, 625061, 67258, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  I really enjoy taking photos of birds of prey and know that taking truly succesful ones, even where the birds are captive, is not a given.  You have captured the perfect moment here with the bird showing a strong degree of intensity.  Focus, composition and depth of field are all good.  10 from me.<br/> <br/>On a side note, I was lucky to see a Red Kite in the wild as I was driving a few weeks ago; I pulled over and watched for a while, bit sadly didn''t have my long lens with me.</td>', 'Back to comment.  I really enjoy taking photos of birds of prey and know that taking truly succesful ones, even where the birds are captive, is not a given.  You have captured the perfect moment here with the bird showing a strong degree of intensity.  Focus, composition and depth of field are all good.  10 from me. On a side note, I was lucky to see a Red Kite in the wild as I was driving a few weeks ago; I pulled over and watched for a while, bit sadly didn''t have my long lens with me.', '2008-01-06 10:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
