(4370468, 627673, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow, that title really makes the image. brilliant.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/> Posthumous Yellow Ribbon</td>', 'wow, that title really makes the image. brilliant.  Posthumous Yellow Ribbon', '2008-01-07 14:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4370496, 620311, 30791, '<td valign="top">my instincts would lead me to believe for a number of reasons that this is Joey Lawrence''s photo, 1 the title, he is well known for S P A C I N G out his titles. 2 the subject of the photo, he did just return from a few countries where exotic and photographic characters are a dime a dozen. and 3 the editing of the photo resembles but is not convincing enough for me to believe this is his photo. reasons being behind that statement, the selective desaturation of the face and hands isn''t something ive seen in his past work. another is again the subject, i find it hard to believe that this particular photo would be the best photo he took that whole month. granted its a great photo. and last i spoke with him a few weeks ago and he stated he doesn''t enter anymore. <br/>so<br/>i am going to go out on a limb and say this is NOT joey''s entry. I love the photo, its moving and defiantly one to keep in the portfolio.<br/>8</td>', 'my instincts would lead me to believe for a number of reasons that this is Joey Lawrence''s photo, 1 the title, he is well known for S P A C I N G out his titles. 2 the subject of the photo, he did just return from a few countries where exotic and photographic characters are a dime a dozen. and 3 the editing of the photo resembles but is not convincing enough for me to believe this is his photo. reasons being behind that statement, the selective desaturation of the face and hands isn''t something ive seen in his past work. another is again the subject, i find it hard to believe that this particular photo would be the best photo he took that whole month. granted its a great photo. and last i spoke with him a few weeks ago and he stated he doesn''t enter anymore. soi am going to go out on a limb and say this is NOT joey''s entry. I love the photo, its moving and defiantly one to keep in the portfolio.8', '2008-01-07 14:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4370526, 620940, 71958, '<td valign="top">i love the picture and texture, but the symetry or composition feels wrong.</td>', 'i love the picture and texture, but the symetry or composition feels wrong.', '2008-01-07 15:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
