(4370819, 627634, 23433, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what I am looking at but it''s interesting.  My guess is that i it''s a side angle of camels cut/smoked out of wood walking back to the east? Weird.? not sure if I "get it" or find it attractive as a photo, but I must say I have looked at this a-lot.</td>', 'I am not sure what I am looking at but it''s interesting.  My guess is that i it''s a side angle of camels cut/smoked out of wood walking back to the east? Weird.? not sure if I "get it" or find it attractive as a photo, but I must say I have looked at this a-lot.', '2008-01-07 16:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
