(4371027, 627729, 83416, '<td valign="top">Believe the composition needs to be improved here  horizon higher or lower in the frame  otherwise it is rather difficult to understand what is to be the subject in the image. Adding some object would also add a nice touch to the image. Good luck!</td>', 'Believe the composition needs to be improved here  horizon higher or lower in the frame  otherwise it is rather difficult to understand what is to be the subject in the image. Adding some object would also add a nice touch to the image. Good luck!', '2008-01-07 18:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
