(4372628, 626611, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice going, Sara. Beautiful photo, good score and impressive placement for a Free Study. I love the processing on this. Seems odd that the street is so empty. The reflection is fabulous.</td>', 'Nice going, Sara. Beautiful photo, good score and impressive placement for a Free Study. I love the processing on this. Seems odd that the street is so empty. The reflection is fabulous.', '2008-01-08 00:37:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372631, 623213, 67697, '<td valign="top">I liked the balance (haha) of the few statues vs. the numerous buildings.  I like how they just naturally pop out of the picture.</td>', 'I liked the balance (haha) of the few statues vs. the numerous buildings.  I like how they just naturally pop out of the picture.', '2008-01-08 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372632, 624746, 30982, '<td valign="top">You hit your prediction dead on - that''s pretty impressive!  In the FWIW department, I gave you a 7, and lingered on this shot for awhile.  I do quite clearly remember it - which is a very good sign in my book.  I don''t mind the blown face at all - it works for me, but I''m not the norm when it comes to "blown".  The grainy-ish background isn''t grainy enough to be grainy, if you know what I mean.  I think it''s a very good shot (love the wisps of hair everywhere!) and the only thing I''d change if possible would be the background.</td>', 'You hit your prediction dead on - that''s pretty impressive!  In the FWIW department, I gave you a 7, and lingered on this shot for awhile.  I do quite clearly remember it - which is a very good sign in my book.  I don''t mind the blown face at all - it works for me, but I''m not the norm when it comes to "blown".  The grainy-ish background isn''t grainy enough to be grainy, if you know what I mean.  I think it''s a very good shot (love the wisps of hair everywhere!) and the only thing I''d change if possible would be the background.', '2008-01-08 00:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372634, 620358, 15266, '<td valign="top">Graphic, well composed, well lighted, well done. :)  Way to go, hon, you did great here.</td>', 'Graphic, well composed, well lighted, well done. :)  Way to go, hon, you did great here.', '2008-01-08 00:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372638, 627241, 67697, '<td valign="top">I was hoping this would score higher.  I love the simplicity of the shot and the lighting is perfect.</td>', 'I was hoping this would score higher.  I love the simplicity of the shot and the lighting is perfect.', '2008-01-08 00:38:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372643, 619368, 30982, '<td valign="top">The green on the right does indeed provide a very nice frame for this - if it were mine, I''d have left it there, too.  EXCELLENT detail and color.  There''s a nice set of diagonals - one with the stem and the insect, and another behind crossing formed from the bokeh.  A very pleasing composition to my eye.  Basically I''m at a loss to tell you how this could score higher - I think it''s pretty darn good.</td>', 'The green on the right does indeed provide a very nice frame for this - if it were mine, I''d have left it there, too.  EXCELLENT detail and color.  There''s a nice set of diagonals - one with the stem and the insect, and another behind crossing formed from the bokeh.  A very pleasing composition to my eye.  Basically I''m at a loss to tell you how this could score higher - I think it''s pretty darn good.', '2008-01-08 00:40:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372647, 620358, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon and new second-best score!  Don''t worry about the low scores;  this just may not have been to everyone''s taste.</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon and new second-best score!  Don''t worry about the low scores;  this just may not have been to everyone''s taste.', '2008-01-08 00:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372652, 620358, 68797, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!<br/> <br/>don''t worry about those 1''s and 2''s  they''re just some jealous pathetic people who like to troll. But as you can see, the score levels out pretty good!</td>', 'Great shot!! don''t worry about those 1''s and 2''s  they''re just some jealous pathetic people who like to troll. But as you can see, the score levels out pretty good!', '2008-01-08 00:41:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372653, 620358, 58728, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, girl.  This is rockin.</td>', 'Beautifully done, girl.  This is rockin.', '2008-01-08 00:41:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372657, 625638, 60862, '<td valign="top">YAHOOOOOO!  Top 10 and a new personal best in a free study of all things.  Congrats, Rob!</td>', 'YAHOOOOOO!  Top 10 and a new personal best in a free study of all things.  Congrats, Rob!', '2008-01-08 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372660, 620311, 64670, '<td valign="top">Said it before, happy to say it again - YOU ROCK!   <br/> <br/>...oh and I''m proud to know ya!</td>', 'Said it before, happy to say it again - YOU ROCK!    ...oh and I''m proud to know ya!', '2008-01-08 00:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372662, 620358, 61818, '<td valign="top">Good looking shot!  What did you airbrush?</td>', 'Good looking shot!  What did you airbrush?', '2008-01-08 00:43:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372666, 627936, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the sentiment expressed here.  It was one of those shots I spent a bit more time on during the challenge, simply because it did indeed have a story to tell.  You know how to score here so I''m not about to tell you things that would have increased your score.  But I do agree that a mid 5 would be far more appropriate than what you ended up with.  Kinda sad statement about the voting population if you ask me.</td>', 'I like the sentiment expressed here.  It was one of those shots I spent a bit more time on during the challenge, simply because it did indeed have a story to tell.  You know how to score here so I''m not about to tell you things that would have increased your score.  But I do agree that a mid 5 would be far more appropriate than what you ended up with.  Kinda sad statement about the voting population if you ask me.', '2008-01-08 00:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372670, 624367, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 20!  And my, oh, my, what eyes!</td>', 'Congrats on top 20!  And my, oh, my, what eyes!', '2008-01-08 00:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372677, 625638, 66384, '<td valign="top">Woohoo! Amazing. Congratulation on the incredible score, PB, and top 10 star. Terrific accomplishment for a Free Study. This image certainly deserved every bit of that. The colors, DOF, focus, and composition are all outstanding.</td>', 'Woohoo! Amazing. Congratulation on the incredible score, PB, and top 10 star. Terrific accomplishment for a Free Study. This image certainly deserved every bit of that. The colors, DOF, focus, and composition are all outstanding.', '2008-01-08 00:45:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372679, 627865, 70514, '<td valign="top">The processing really adds power to the overall image.  Wow!</td>', 'The processing really adds power to the overall image.  Wow!', '2008-01-08 00:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372683, 627124, 30982, '<td valign="top">The problem with wildlife is they''re designed to blend in, silly things!  Don''t they know how hard that makes it for us to get their pictures?  It would be hard given the light and the setting here to truly make that little guy stand out, unless you did something freaky like desaturate everything except the bird, and that quite often just looks silly.<br/> <br/>You got some good comments during the challenge that explain why people voted the way they did - and that''s a good thing.  I''m curious as to why you only marked some as "helpful", though.  While they may not see the shot the same way you do, at least they''ve offered some reasons as to why.  <br/> <br/>One thing you might try is cropping the top off even though it cuts off the support of the nest ball.  By cropping and making it a landscape oriented image, it brings the bird into play a bit more as far as where the eye goes in the shot.  Try it and see what you think.</td>', 'The problem with wildlife is they''re designed to blend in, silly things!  Don''t they know how hard that makes it for us to get their pictures?  It would be hard given the light and the setting here to truly make that little guy stand out, unless you did something freaky like desaturate everything except the bird, and that quite often just looks silly. You got some good comments during the challenge that explain why people voted the way they did - and that''s a good thing.  I''m curious as to why you only marked some as "helpful", though.  While they may not see the shot the same way you do, at least they''ve offered some reasons as to why.   One thing you might try is cropping the top off even though it cuts off the support of the nest ball.  By cropping and making it a landscape oriented image, it brings the bird into play a bit more as far as where the eye goes in the shot.  Try it and see what you think.', '2008-01-08 00:48:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372685, 626489, 24974, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the win. Fabulous shot!</td>', 'Congrats on the win. Fabulous shot!', '2008-01-08 00:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372687, 624367, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is a top 3 shot, it''s a shame it didn''t place higher.</td>', 'This is a top 3 shot, it''s a shame it didn''t place higher.', '2008-01-08 00:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372692, 620358, 24974, '<td valign="top">Very cool image! Congrats.</td>', 'Very cool image! Congrats.', '2008-01-08 00:52:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372705, 627896, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think it''s very well exposed - not every shot has to be massively contrasty, nor is every day a perfect sunset/dramatic clouds in sky kinda day.  What I liked about this when I saw it was her smile.  She strikes me as very self-confident and just a bit of an imp.  And though it''s probably not politically correct to mention, I liked the indications that she''s growing into early womanhood - to me, that''s very sweet.  As with a lot of my shots, if I like it, and if the person who''s picture it is likes it, it''s golden, regardless of what everyone else thinks.  From a DPC perspective, this will indeed be seen as a snapshot.  To you and your cousin, an excellent memory of a great afternoon together.  Which is the better of the two?  :-)</td>', 'I think it''s very well exposed - not every shot has to be massively contrasty, nor is every day a perfect sunset/dramatic clouds in sky kinda day.  What I liked about this when I saw it was her smile.  She strikes me as very self-confident and just a bit of an imp.  And though it''s probably not politically correct to mention, I liked the indications that she''s growing into early womanhood - to me, that''s very sweet.  As with a lot of my shots, if I like it, and if the person who''s picture it is likes it, it''s golden, regardless of what everyone else thinks.  From a DPC perspective, this will indeed be seen as a snapshot.  To you and your cousin, an excellent memory of a great afternoon together.  Which is the better of the two?  :-)', '2008-01-08 00:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372711, 625221, 66616, '<td valign="top">I didnt get to vote on this but I think it looks great. I have tried some hdr but I cant get this effect, I am baffled.</td>', 'I didnt get to vote on this but I think it looks great. I have tried some hdr but I cant get this effect, I am baffled.', '2008-01-08 00:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372714, 624746, 15305, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice image overall, but for DPC standards, the focus is too soft besides the blown out highlights in the face.</td>', 'It''s a nice image overall, but for DPC standards, the focus is too soft besides the blown out highlights in the face.', '2008-01-08 01:00:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372717, 626489, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Manny.  Great image (happy to be one of your 25 tens). ;-) <br/>Looking forward to seeing more of your India photos.</td>', 'Congratulations, Manny.  Great image (happy to be one of your 25 tens). ;-) Looking forward to seeing more of your India photos.', '2008-01-08 01:01:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372718, 626113, 83416, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the top 10!</td>', 'Congratulations on the top 10!', '2008-01-08 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372719, 623531, 15305, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice simple image, perhaps too simple for DPC standards. I think a more agressive post processing would have had a better impact to DPC crowd, thus raising the score.</td>', 'It''s a nice simple image, perhaps too simple for DPC standards. I think a more agressive post processing would have had a better impact to DPC crowd, thus raising the score.', '2008-01-08 01:01:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372724, 625904, 65319, '<td valign="top">::sigh::...a poignant capture to capture the heart...</td>', '::sigh::...a poignant capture to capture the heart...', '2008-01-08 01:03:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372725, 627936, 15305, '<td valign="top">I like the relaxed mood and the story behind the picture, but bear in mind that this kind of shots that are of photojournalism quality do not score high at DPC.</td>', 'I like the relaxed mood and the story behind the picture, but bear in mind that this kind of shots that are of photojournalism quality do not score high at DPC.', '2008-01-08 01:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372726, 626327, 61961, '<td valign="top">Big congratulations on your ribbon.  I''m happy to have been one of your 10 votes.  Funny, my laptop screen is also spotty, so I didn''t notice the sensor dust, either.</td>', 'Big congratulations on your ribbon.  I''m happy to have been one of your 10 votes.  Funny, my laptop screen is also spotty, so I didn''t notice the sensor dust, either.', '2008-01-08 01:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372727, 620358, 78821, '<td valign="top">seee?? I TOLD you you would ribbon. d= congrats!</td>', 'seee?? I TOLD you you would ribbon. d= congrats!', '2008-01-08 01:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372729, 626489, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is a truly beautiful photograph. Congratulations on your well-deserved win.<br/>Ann</td>', 'This is a truly beautiful photograph. Congratulations on your well-deserved win.Ann', '2008-01-08 01:04:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372731, 627729, 53814, '<td valign="top">Merci et les meilleurs voeux à vous Jean-Jacques. Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Merci et les meilleurs voeux à vous Jean-Jacques. Beautiful photo.', '2008-01-08 01:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372737, 627896, 52713, '<td valign="top">sweet shot, probably a little too snap shot-ish for a Free Study. I''m glad you entered a shot that had meaning to you. I did the same and barely scored higher.<br/> <br/>If you had used the 50mm Macro with all that mojo you would have scored a full point higher, for sure! ;-)  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 01:08:24.</i></td>', 'sweet shot, probably a little too snap shot-ish for a Free Study. I''m glad you entered a shot that had meaning to you. I did the same and barely scored higher. If you had used the 50mm Macro with all that mojo you would have scored a full point higher, for sure! ;-)  ', '2008-01-08 01:06:35.000000', '2008-01-08 01:08:24.000000', 0),
(4372738, 620358, 25355, '<td valign="top">This is cutting-edge photography, worthy of a really trendy fashion magazine (I guess, not being into really trendy fashion magazines myself). ;-)<br/>Congratulations on the Ribbon.</td>', 'This is cutting-edge photography, worthy of a really trendy fashion magazine (I guess, not being into really trendy fashion magazines myself). ;-)Congratulations on the Ribbon.', '2008-01-08 01:06:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372739, 627124, 15305, '<td valign="top">I completely agree with Melethia! There is poor contrast between the subject and the rest of the background. In this case the background is too busy, so maybe a selective desaturation would have helped.</td>', 'I completely agree with Melethia! There is poor contrast between the subject and the rest of the background. In this case the background is too busy, so maybe a selective desaturation would have helped.', '2008-01-08 01:06:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372749, 627896, 15305, '<td valign="top">I think that a little work on the pose would have made a whole lot of difference. But as you said, the important thing is that it is a meaningful shot to you.</td>', 'I think that a little work on the pose would have made a whole lot of difference. But as you said, the important thing is that it is a meaningful shot to you.', '2008-01-08 01:09:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372752, 624633, 60862, '<td valign="top">Well, I still say this is a beautiful shot with a dramatic sky. So :P to the voters.</td>', 'Well, I still say this is a beautiful shot with a dramatic sky. So :P to the voters.', '2008-01-08 01:10:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372754, 623933, 25355, '<td valign="top">The unusual composition was probably its main failing, with such a close crop to the clock tower. Also, too bad about the crane at the back, and the unlit building in the centre.</td>', 'The unusual composition was probably its main failing, with such a close crop to the clock tower. Also, too bad about the crane at the back, and the unlit building in the centre.', '2008-01-08 01:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372758, 620405, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re good with cardinals.  Now try bishops.  <br/>:-)</td>', 'You''re good with cardinals.  Now try bishops.  :-)', '2008-01-08 01:11:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372761, 626489, 49643, '<td valign="top">Excellent Shot! Congratulations :)</td>', 'Excellent Shot! Congratulations :)', '2008-01-08 01:11:58.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4372762, 623531, 53147, '<td valign="top">I remember thinking pretty much this in voting - "Cute shot, wish the dog was really in focus... it''s the feet, the feet are cool, stepping up just a bit, thats just cool."<br/> <br/>Now had it been a cat instead of a dog with those feet in the background - 10!</td>', 'I remember thinking pretty much this in voting - "Cute shot, wish the dog was really in focus... it''s the feet, the feet are cool, stepping up just a bit, thats just cool." Now had it been a cat instead of a dog with those feet in the background - 10!', '2008-01-08 01:12:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372779, 628003, 5885, '<td valign="top">I do believe thou did get robbed!</td>', 'I do believe thou did get robbed!', '2008-01-08 01:19:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372781, 626872, 30982, '<td valign="top">The processing, as you can tell by the comments, is a matter of taste.  Some really like it, some not so much.  My first impression was it was too much contrast for this scene.  The stillness suggests something softer to me.  The composition is very strong - I like the split horizon - but again, it''s a matter of taste.  Some may prefer a more "rule of thirds" comp with respect to the horizon.  The basic shot is excellent.  I think it would be interesting to see other edits of this shot.</td>', 'The processing, as you can tell by the comments, is a matter of taste.  Some really like it, some not so much.  My first impression was it was too much contrast for this scene.  The stillness suggests something softer to me.  The composition is very strong - I like the split horizon - but again, it''s a matter of taste.  Some may prefer a more "rule of thirds" comp with respect to the horizon.  The basic shot is excellent.  I think it would be interesting to see other edits of this shot.', '2008-01-08 01:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372788, 620358, 52549, '<td valign="top">Now this is truly fabulous. Great work, Claire! I agree with Tanja on the givers of 1''s and 2''s.<br/>Congratulation on your ribbon and a very fine piece of work.</td>', 'Now this is truly fabulous. Great work, Claire! I agree with Tanja on the givers of 1''s and 2''s.Congratulation on your ribbon and a very fine piece of work.', '2008-01-08 01:21:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372791, 620405, 25355, '<td valign="top">Wow. Classic red bird-in-the-woods shot, hence your title, I guess ;-)<br/>   I wonder if they would be considered ugly birds if it wasn''t for the bright colour...</td>', 'Wow. Classic red bird-in-the-woods shot, hence your title, I guess ;-)   I wonder if they would be considered ugly birds if it wasn''t for the bright colour...', '2008-01-08 01:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372807, 626489, 36371, '<td valign="top">WoW! Congratulations!</td>', 'WoW! Congratulations!', '2008-01-08 01:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372808, 624387, 30982, '<td valign="top">WTF?  No frickin'' way.  I really like this.  I apparently have no taste whatsoever.  This is probably the finest brown DPC has had in ages.</td>', 'WTF?  No frickin'' way.  I really like this.  I apparently have no taste whatsoever.  This is probably the finest brown DPC has had in ages.', '2008-01-08 01:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372809, 626327, 36371, '<td valign="top">automatic favorite! Love this! Congratulations on your red!</td>', 'automatic favorite! Love this! Congratulations on your red!', '2008-01-08 01:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372812, 621200, 33352, '<td valign="top">Top 100 in free study, like your lift in technique &amp; style.</td>', 'Top 100 in free study, like your lift in technique & style.', '2008-01-08 01:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372817, 626489, 66398, '<td valign="top">congrats... well deserved!<br/>I didn''t vote but did look through all the thumbs and your shot grabbed me right away just from the thumbnail as a ribbon winner.</td>', 'congrats... well deserved!I didn''t vote but did look through all the thumbs and your shot grabbed me right away just from the thumbnail as a ribbon winner.', '2008-01-08 01:36:17.000000', NULL, 0),
