(4372879, 623531, 33352, '<td valign="top">And of course being an animal lover had nothing to do with your wanting to enter this photo, good catch.</td>', 'And of course being an animal lover had nothing to do with your wanting to enter this photo, good catch.', '2008-01-08 02:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372881, 625904, 70514, '<td valign="top">Perfect processing for the subjects.  Wonderful capture and emotion.</td>', 'Perfect processing for the subjects.  Wonderful capture and emotion.', '2008-01-08 02:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372882, 627124, 32786, '<td valign="top">I was thinking that if the nest was sharper or perhaps brighter it would help the photo. that nest just sucks my eyes into it. I think the bird is captured very well but the nest distracts from the bird.just a thought I like the background. I was also thinking perhaps a little higher Iso and a faster shutter speed would of helped you.that bird had to be moving a little bit with the nest.  then again I also like the picture the way it is as it has started to grow on me the more I look at at. Do you have any other edits of that picture  you could post? "</td>', 'I was thinking that if the nest was sharper or perhaps brighter it would help the photo. that nest just sucks my eyes into it. I think the bird is captured very well but the nest distracts from the bird.just a thought I like the background. I was also thinking perhaps a little higher Iso and a faster shutter speed would of helped you.that bird had to be moving a little bit with the nest.  then again I also like the picture the way it is as it has started to grow on me the more I look at at. Do you have any other edits of that picture  you could post? "', '2008-01-08 02:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372888, 627639, 30982, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a shot that Goodman did.  I voted it significantly higher than the average and really rather enjoyed it!  I''d offer why it scored under 6 but really it doesn''t matter.  I think the processing works just fine and I think it''s a very good shot.</td>', 'This reminds me of a shot that Goodman did.  I voted it significantly higher than the average and really rather enjoyed it!  I''d offer why it scored under 6 but really it doesn''t matter.  I think the processing works just fine and I think it''s a very good shot.', '2008-01-08 02:09:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372898, 620872, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well I was one of your two 7s.  I quite liked the moment.  I think (and I''ve said this before) that we get so wrapped up in the beautifully crafted photograph here that we miss way too many moments.  Technically, it could do with something to isolate your subject a bit better, or at least bring him out more.  But I kinda like finding him without being shown.</td>', 'Well I was one of your two 7s.  I quite liked the moment.  I think (and I''ve said this before) that we get so wrapped up in the beautifully crafted photograph here that we miss way too many moments.  Technically, it could do with something to isolate your subject a bit better, or at least bring him out more.  But I kinda like finding him without being shown.', '2008-01-08 02:12:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372899, 626006, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love the dramatic effect (in my opinion) the sky has on the Pagoda.</td>', 'I love the dramatic effect (in my opinion) the sky has on the Pagoda.', '2008-01-08 02:13:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372901, 628012, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite liked the oddness of this.  Probably not "wow!" enough for a free study, but it was a nice shot to pop up during voting.  One sometimes tires of perfectly rendered landscapes and this was a delightful change!</td>', 'I quite liked the oddness of this.  Probably not "wow!" enough for a free study, but it was a nice shot to pop up during voting.  One sometimes tires of perfectly rendered landscapes and this was a delightful change!', '2008-01-08 02:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372902, 620872, 70514, '<td valign="top">This makes me giggle!  Great timing on the capture.</td>', 'This makes me giggle!  Great timing on the capture.', '2008-01-08 02:14:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372903, 620358, 54033, '<td valign="top"><b>lovethelight said:</b> <i>"ps. I was wondering if the people who gave me 1s and 2s could tell me what it is they didn''t like about it, because I have gotten a lot of positive feedback on this but would like to hear some negative feedback"</i> <br/> <br/>Your photo is technically good; but as you may appreciate, sometimes mere taste is a decisive factor in weighing a photos score; in a photo such as yours 1,2,3,4 even 5 represent the same attitude towards this type of photography. This does not necessarily reflect my exact opinion on such photos, but it is a response I felt you are entitled to.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the ribbon<br/> <br/>Tareq<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 02:32:41.</i></td>', 'lovethelight said: "ps. I was wondering if the people who gave me 1s and 2s could tell me what it is they didn''t like about it, because I have gotten a lot of positive feedback on this but would like to hear some negative feedback"  Your photo is technically good; but as you may appreciate, sometimes mere taste is a decisive factor in weighing a photos score; in a photo such as yours 1,2,3,4 even 5 represent the same attitude towards this type of photography. This does not necessarily reflect my exact opinion on such photos, but it is a response I felt you are entitled to. Congratulations on the ribbon Tareq', '2008-01-08 02:15:17.000000', '2008-01-08 02:32:41.000000', 0),
(4372905, 627966, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''m very fond of little child hands doing wonderful things.  This is underrated, in my opinion.  I like the softness and composition.  Very sweet.</td>', 'I''m very fond of little child hands doing wonderful things.  This is underrated, in my opinion.  I like the softness and composition.  Very sweet.', '2008-01-08 02:16:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372909, 626327, 7786, '<td valign="top">Congrats with your yellow ribbon. Well deserved.</td>', 'Congrats with your yellow ribbon. Well deserved.', '2008-01-08 02:17:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372910, 626489, 7786, '<td valign="top">Oustanding image. A well deserved blue ribbon. I look forward seeing more from India on your pbase account.</td>', 'Oustanding image. A well deserved blue ribbon. I look forward seeing more from India on your pbase account.', '2008-01-08 02:18:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372911, 627821, 30982, '<td valign="top">What I liked was the way the flames were framing him so well.  I also like the way it''s sort of quietly muted, not oversaturated or overbright - very much in keeping with the smokey atmosphere at a fire.  The only nit would be the focus on his face.  But I still think it''s quite a nice environmental portrait and he has a great smile.</td>', 'What I liked was the way the flames were framing him so well.  I also like the way it''s sort of quietly muted, not oversaturated or overbright - very much in keeping with the smokey atmosphere at a fire.  The only nit would be the focus on his face.  But I still think it''s quite a nice environmental portrait and he has a great smile.', '2008-01-08 02:18:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372912, 625118, 63398, '<td valign="top">This looks so raw and prehistoric......beautiful in its primeval simplicity.</td>', 'This looks so raw and prehistoric......beautiful in its primeval simplicity.', '2008-01-08 02:19:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372915, 627936, 63398, '<td valign="top">I can see why this bombed score-wise......you have to get into the image and feel the moment. Doesn''t happen in the two to three second voting window. Quite a nice capture of an intense time IMO.</td>', 'I can see why this bombed score-wise......you have to get into the image and feel the moment. Doesn''t happen in the two to three second voting window. Quite a nice capture of an intense time IMO.', '2008-01-08 02:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372916, 627229, 30982, '<td valign="top">Blur shots, in general, are not well appreciated here except by folks who really like them and do them on purpose.  I like this.  I''m one of those folks.  So to get a better score at DPC, don''t blur!  But if you are gonna blur, let your own taste guide you as to what you like and don''t like.  My one nit with this would be the centered comp.  Sometimes it works, sometimes not so much.  I can''t say for sure with this, but it might be worth playing with a bit to see if there''s a crop or composition that makes it a bit less static (which is hard to say about a motion captured shot).  Oh, and I''d have him bombing out of the shot, which is another DPC no-no.  And since I''m a monochrome gal at heart, this is very nearly there but not quite.  You could try saturation to bring out the color, or go all the way to B&amp;W with it.  I''m glad you chose to enter this.</td>', 'Blur shots, in general, are not well appreciated here except by folks who really like them and do them on purpose.  I like this.  I''m one of those folks.  So to get a better score at DPC, don''t blur!  But if you are gonna blur, let your own taste guide you as to what you like and don''t like.  My one nit with this would be the centered comp.  Sometimes it works, sometimes not so much.  I can''t say for sure with this, but it might be worth playing with a bit to see if there''s a crop or composition that makes it a bit less static (which is hard to say about a motion captured shot).  Oh, and I''d have him bombing out of the shot, which is another DPC no-no.  And since I''m a monochrome gal at heart, this is very nearly there but not quite.  You could try saturation to bring out the color, or go all the way to B&W with it.  I''m glad you chose to enter this.', '2008-01-08 02:26:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372919, 619368, 63398, '<td valign="top">I might like to see how this looks with the leaf on the right cropped out. Though it doen''t hurt the image IMO, it may give the image more spatial balance. I dunno.....if you try an edit that way, let me know as I''d love to see it. I do love the grasshopper''s brilliance!</td>', 'I might like to see how this looks with the leaf on the right cropped out. Though it doen''t hurt the image IMO, it may give the image more spatial balance. I dunno.....if you try an edit that way, let me know as I''d love to see it. I do love the grasshopper''s brilliance!', '2008-01-08 02:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4372920, 626403, 30982, '<td valign="top">The lighting is quite good for this, though the more professional portrait types could give you a better critique.  Me, I love his smile!  I will say I''m not fond of the background.  For a portrait, a plain background is probably good, but to give the shot a three-dimensional look, I think it needs some texture to it of some sort - but that''s a personal preference.  I''d say overall in the challenge it did pretty well.</td>', 'The lighting is quite good for this, though the more professional portrait types could give you a better critique.  Me, I love his smile!  I will say I''m not fond of the background.  For a portrait, a plain background is probably good, but to give the shot a three-dimensional look, I think it needs some texture to it of some sort - but that''s a personal preference.  I''d say overall in the challenge it did pretty well.', '2008-01-08 02:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
