(4373013, 626327, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent minimalist presentation.  I''m very glad you stopped!  You can fix the sensor dust when you have it printed.  ''Grats on the ribbon and in a FS no less!</td>', 'An excellent minimalist presentation.  I''m very glad you stopped!  You can fix the sensor dust when you have it printed.  ''Grats on the ribbon and in a FS no less!', '2008-01-08 04:22:59.000000', NULL, 0),
