(4373071, 627086, 674, '<td valign="top">I gave this 7 I really liked it but would have liked the tree and the moon less central.</td>', 'I gave this 7 I really liked it but would have liked the tree and the moon less central.', '2008-01-08 06:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373072, 620405, 67152, '<td valign="top">How am I suppose to vote you down on your entries if you don''t make it obvious which entry is yours?  Changing models like this should result in some kind of banishment from the site...<br/> <br/>Cool shot - I love how the reds and oranges are seen throughout the image.  The details on your little friend are so nicely captured and the ''facial expression'' on this majestic little bird is priceless - as if saying to his wife  "Come on now, finishing eating...it''s my turn"</td>', 'How am I suppose to vote you down on your entries if you don''t make it obvious which entry is yours?  Changing models like this should result in some kind of banishment from the site... Cool shot - I love how the reds and oranges are seen throughout the image.  The details on your little friend are so nicely captured and the ''facial expression'' on this majestic little bird is priceless - as if saying to his wife  "Come on now, finishing eating...it''s my turn"', '2008-01-08 06:05:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373074, 624550, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro Catherine - the colors and sharpness are very good.  I just wonder if the background is a bit too bright - I seem to think we lose this little fellow in the light.</td>', 'Excellent macro Catherine - the colors and sharpness are very good.  I just wonder if the background is a bit too bright - I seem to think we lose this little fellow in the light.', '2008-01-08 06:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373075, 627896, 674, '<td valign="top">I liked the shot but felt it would probably not do well as it has a slightly family holiday album feel to the pose. It is beautifully exposed though.</td>', 'I liked the shot but felt it would probably not do well as it has a slightly family holiday album feel to the pose. It is beautifully exposed though.', '2008-01-08 06:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373076, 627086, 32345, '<td valign="top">I always liked those kind of pictures, so I''m a little bias here. This shoud have finish well into the 6''s. The colors are just great. Have you tried cropping out most of the field at the bottom? It would be interesting to see the result.</td>', 'I always liked those kind of pictures, so I''m a little bias here. This shoud have finish well into the 6''s. The colors are just great. Have you tried cropping out most of the field at the bottom? It would be interesting to see the result.', '2008-01-08 06:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373080, 622456, 32345, '<td valign="top">Focus seems right on the feathers and the colors are well saturated, but it''s too bad that the bird is not looking the other way. I also think that the heavy vigneting around the picture is distracting.</td>', 'Focus seems right on the feathers and the colors are well saturated, but it''s too bad that the bird is not looking the other way. I also think that the heavy vigneting around the picture is distracting.', '2008-01-08 06:17:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373084, 627043, 32345, '<td valign="top">Like Melethia said, this should not be below 5. I also think that the arm is distracting and I think that it would have been nice if the top and the right of the hairs was not cut off. Besides that, it''s a very good portrait.</td>', 'Like Melethia said, this should not be below 5. I also think that the arm is distracting and I think that it would have been nice if the top and the right of the hairs was not cut off. Besides that, it''s a very good portrait.', '2008-01-08 06:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373087, 627253, 32345, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes and great focus on them. But I think that the crop is a little too tight, an other point might be the color, overall, it looks a bit too redish.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes and great focus on them. But I think that the crop is a little too tight, an other point might be the color, overall, it looks a bit too redish.', '2008-01-08 06:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373090, 624367, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hey...congrats on such a high placement.</td>', 'Hey...congrats on such a high placement.', '2008-01-08 06:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373092, 619354, 78062, '<td valign="top">Ya know what? I really like this. I like how it isn''t technically ''perfect'' and is at least something different and out of the norm and i suspect, against the grain of DPC where it''s super polished, slick advertisement-looking pictures, not that there''s anything wrong with them, but I find it refreshing when someone suibmits a picture like this, that is not worried about the technicals, but still comes out pretty good and looking like a pop-art pic.<br/> <br/>I don''t really like the grey in there but I love the texturing on the floor, but i''m like that.<br/> <br/>Don''t worry about the votes, it''s a nice pic. Put it in b/w and it would give it a whole new dimension.</td>', 'Ya know what? I really like this. I like how it isn''t technically ''perfect'' and is at least something different and out of the norm and i suspect, against the grain of DPC where it''s super polished, slick advertisement-looking pictures, not that there''s anything wrong with them, but I find it refreshing when someone suibmits a picture like this, that is not worried about the technicals, but still comes out pretty good and looking like a pop-art pic. I don''t really like the grey in there but I love the texturing on the floor, but i''m like that. Don''t worry about the votes, it''s a nice pic. Put it in b/w and it would give it a whole new dimension.', '2008-01-08 06:32:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373095, 620358, 19982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon Claire!  Well done and well deserved!  <br/> <br/>Just thinking about what might have helped it score a little higher...  I''m thinking that maybe a little more detail in the whites (the nose and flower details).  Not a lot, or it would spoil the effect.  But just enough to give the viewer a little more to hang onto.  <br/> <br/>Anyway, congrats on another 7+ finish!  :-)<br/></td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon Claire!  Well done and well deserved!   Just thinking about what might have helped it score a little higher...  I''m thinking that maybe a little more detail in the whites (the nose and flower details).  Not a lot, or it would spoil the effect.  But just enough to give the viewer a little more to hang onto.   Anyway, congrats on another 7+ finish!  :-)', '2008-01-08 06:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373103, 624389, 19982, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous image, to be sure.  I would have expected a higher score from this one.</td>', 'A gorgeous image, to be sure.  I would have expected a higher score from this one.', '2008-01-08 06:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373107, 623247, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow! Gorgeous shot Mark!  I''m surprised that this is under the 7.0 mark.  But you were up against some tough competition.  This really is gorgeous though!<br/></td>', 'Wow! Gorgeous shot Mark!  I''m surprised that this is under the 7.0 mark.  But you were up against some tough competition.  This really is gorgeous though!', '2008-01-08 06:45:03.000000', NULL, 0),
