(4373115, 623933, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pug-H:</b></div><hr/><i> The unusual composition was probably its main failing, with such a close crop to the clock tower. Also, too bad about the crane at the back, and the unlit building in the centre. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I knew about the crane couldn''t edit it off due to something happening in my personal life... and just wanted to seee how it would do... =]<br/> <br/>Composition wise I wanted to be a bit different and to be honest I quiet like the unlit building but it''s all good!</td>', 'Originally posted by Pug-H: The unusual composition was probably its main failing, with such a close crop to the clock tower. Also, too bad about the crane at the back, and the unlit building in the centre.   I knew about the crane couldn''t edit it off due to something happening in my personal life... and just wanted to seee how it would do... =] Composition wise I wanted to be a bit different and to be honest I quiet like the unlit building but it''s all good!', '2008-01-08 06:51:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373117, 623247, 75048, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull shot, very nice work and excellent picture. Everything matches, the colours, the reflection and yours daughter beutifull face. This one should have got the Golden ribbon. Congrats...</td>', 'Wonderfull shot, very nice work and excellent picture. Everything matches, the colours, the reflection and yours daughter beutifull face. This one should have got the Golden ribbon. Congrats...', '2008-01-08 06:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
