(4373207, 622905, 74979, '<td valign="top">sweet image Julianne!  Hang in there now &amp; don''t get frustrated with that Canon!  Birds can be difficult to keep still eh? Birds not always cooperative with staying still eh?</td>', 'sweet image Julianne!  Hang in there now & don''t get frustrated with that Canon!  Birds can be difficult to keep still eh? Birds not always cooperative with staying still eh?', '2008-01-08 08:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373210, 622456, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see what you saw, but I did see a bird that seemed rather shy, trying to hide from you but still peeking out to see what you''re up to.  I thought it kinda sweet.  I just looked at your score - definitely better than that.  DPC voters have become a rather harsh lot!</td>', 'I didn''t see what you saw, but I did see a bird that seemed rather shy, trying to hide from you but still peeking out to see what you''re up to.  I thought it kinda sweet.  I just looked at your score - definitely better than that.  DPC voters have become a rather harsh lot!', '2008-01-08 08:01:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373211, 624746, 32595, '<td valign="top">I do like this, <br/>I like the expression on her face. A certain peace to it. And confidence.<br/>Her hair seems to flow upwards Without having been flung there.<br/>Like it was willed there. Or divine intervention. Hence the glow to her face.<br/>The lines on the black-board I find a little distracting<br/>Maybe a darker background would show off her face more<br/>I do like the brightness of the face<br/>Leaves me wondering what she may be looking at.<br/>Greg<br/> <br/></td>', 'I do like this, I like the expression on her face. A certain peace to it. And confidence.Her hair seems to flow upwards Without having been flung there.Like it was willed there. Or divine intervention. Hence the glow to her face.The lines on the black-board I find a little distractingMaybe a darker background would show off her face moreI do like the brightness of the faceLeaves me wondering what she may be looking at.Greg ', '2008-01-08 08:01:38.000000', NULL, 0),
