(4373236, 624746, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is something about this photo that made me think of a romantisised idea of drowning - of slowly sinking to the depths.  Obviously the hair adds to this feel, but also the grainy, mottled background (which i thought fine, by the way).  For me the brightness of the face was just a little too much, and I found the horizontal line at neck level very distracting.  Nonetheless, this photo elicited a strong emotional reaction in me which is good.</td>', 'There is something about this photo that made me think of a romantisised idea of drowning - of slowly sinking to the depths.  Obviously the hair adds to this feel, but also the grainy, mottled background (which i thought fine, by the way).  For me the brightness of the face was just a little too much, and I found the horizontal line at neck level very distracting.  Nonetheless, this photo elicited a strong emotional reaction in me which is good.', '2008-01-08 08:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373238, 627904, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot Don. I''m surprised that you scored as high as you did with a shot that is so nice. Doesn''t make sense does it?</td>', 'Very nice shot Don. I''m surprised that you scored as high as you did with a shot that is so nice. Doesn''t make sense does it?', '2008-01-08 08:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
