(4373249, 620561, 74979, '<td valign="top"><i>and life goes on</i>....eh?<br/> <br/>read all the comments during the challenge some simply hilarious.  This is an amazing capture and simply stunning when the content slams the viewer roght b/tw their eyes.  It doesn''t strike me as anything but nature at work and I am amazed you were able to capture the "moment" without the ram charging you for privacy violation... :)<br/> <br/>very strong work! congrats!!</td>', 'and life goes on....eh? read all the comments during the challenge some simply hilarious.  This is an amazing capture and simply stunning when the content slams the viewer roght b/tw their eyes.  It doesn''t strike me as anything but nature at work and I am amazed you were able to capture the "moment" without the ram charging you for privacy violation... :) very strong work! congrats!!', '2008-01-08 08:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373255, 626489, 14386, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot everyone.  India was an overwhelming exeprience.  It''s one big stage...wherever you point your camera is worth "freezing".   The people are just amazing.  So much character and so much colours all over.  A must-see place for photographers.  You can''t go wrong with portraits there.:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 19:03:40.</i></td>', 'Thanks a lot everyone.  India was an overwhelming exeprience.  It''s one big stage...wherever you point your camera is worth "freezing".   The people are just amazing.  So much character and so much colours all over.  A must-see place for photographers.  You can''t go wrong with portraits there.:)', '2008-01-08 08:15:58.000000', '2008-01-08 19:03:40.000000', 0),
(4373257, 626660, 74979, '<td valign="top">excellent Shez!!  congrats on a very nice finish in a FS packed with talent!  I love the capture-might make a great ad for the Dairy association''s <i>got milk??</i>campaign here in the states...</td>', 'excellent Shez!!  congrats on a very nice finish in a FS packed with talent!  I love the capture-might make a great ad for the Dairy association''s got milk??campaign here in the states...', '2008-01-08 08:16:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373258, 619368, 67258, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 6, so was (unusually for me) there with the bulk of DPC voters.  In the photos favour, detail is very good with crisp focus and a depth of field suited to the subject; I particularly liked the antennae reaching up into the light.  Things that I might prefer different - that the insect was at least partially facing the viewer; that the little ''hands'' were also in focus; that the strip of brighter green was not included.  With regard the brighter green, I note that you say you liked it and felt it provided a natural border, but for me it somewhat unbalanced the composition and seemed somewhat superlous to the overall photograph.  All in all, though, good work.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 6, so was (unusually for me) there with the bulk of DPC voters.  In the photos favour, detail is very good with crisp focus and a depth of field suited to the subject; I particularly liked the antennae reaching up into the light.  Things that I might prefer different - that the insect was at least partially facing the viewer; that the little ''hands'' were also in focus; that the strip of brighter green was not included.  With regard the brighter green, I note that you say you liked it and felt it provided a natural border, but for me it somewhat unbalanced the composition and seemed somewhat superlous to the overall photograph.  All in all, though, good work.', '2008-01-08 08:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373262, 627936, 58691, '<td valign="top">David<br/>I like this shot, but I probably would''ve cropped out the ceiling/rafters and fan. I don''t see how this scored a &lt;5, though. There does seem to be a little scarring on the subject''s jaw.</td>', 'DavidI like this shot, but I probably would''ve cropped out the ceiling/rafters and fan. I don''t see how this scored a <5, though. There does seem to be a little scarring on the subject''s jaw.', '2008-01-08 08:19:14.000000', NULL, 0),
