(4373524, 626926, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Lesley!  Dang.  This makes me want to cry!   I think part of it is because I love elephants SO MUCH. . . and I feel so sad for the elephant in our zoo (or ANY elephant in any zoo) because they can''t get out and play together like this!   A couple of weeks ago my favorite elephant just died.  They don''t know why, but now they are fearing the other one is grieving himself to death :(   I think he died of a broken heart because he can''t get out and play like these elephants can!</td>', 'Oh Lesley!  Dang.  This makes me want to cry!   I think part of it is because I love elephants SO MUCH. . . and I feel so sad for the elephant in our zoo (or ANY elephant in any zoo) because they can''t get out and play together like this!   A couple of weeks ago my favorite elephant just died.  They don''t know why, but now they are fearing the other one is grieving himself to death :(   I think he died of a broken heart because he can''t get out and play like these elephants can!', '2008-01-08 10:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
