(4373535, 627049, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!  I''d think I had died and landed in heaven to see a magnificent bird like this in the wild.  There is something so majestically haunting about owls!  This one is shot and processed to perfection.</td>', 'Oh yes!  I''d think I had died and landed in heaven to see a magnificent bird like this in the wild.  There is something so majestically haunting about owls!  This one is shot and processed to perfection.', '2008-01-08 10:16:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373540, 620911, 11800, '<td valign="top">The cut off tree runs almost in the center of the frame. So it has cut it into two sections. That is the first thing I notice. I wasn''t there so I don''t know if it was possible for you to move over more towards the left of the picture, but that seems to be a better spot to get the group of trees out of the center. I want to see the river and the trees are blocking my view. The color is good but not enough of a draw to overcome the flawed composition which is made unbearable by the cut off tree. Eventually that is all I can see in the picture.  It''s a real shame because it is a lovely place.</td>', 'The cut off tree runs almost in the center of the frame. So it has cut it into two sections. That is the first thing I notice. I wasn''t there so I don''t know if it was possible for you to move over more towards the left of the picture, but that seems to be a better spot to get the group of trees out of the center. I want to see the river and the trees are blocking my view. The color is good but not enough of a draw to overcome the flawed composition which is made unbearable by the cut off tree. Eventually that is all I can see in the picture.  It''s a real shame because it is a lovely place.', '2008-01-08 10:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373541, 627609, 24454, '<td valign="top">Jeeeez, I love your mysty fog photos.  This is beautiful!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Jeeeez, I love your mysty fog photos.  This is beautiful! ', '2008-01-08 10:18:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373544, 627704, 50695, '<td valign="top">Impressive. It''s at the point now where I eagerly await each new entry from you. I''m a fan!</td>', 'Impressive. It''s at the point now where I eagerly await each new entry from you. I''m a fan!', '2008-01-08 10:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
