(4373645, 625276, 67152, '<td valign="top">Golly Karen.  This one is awesome.  I didn''t get to vote on it but I would have given this an 8 or 9.  Stunning control of exposure on the snow, wonderful rich blue sky and excellent framing by the pines. I think my only nitpick is that I would have liked the path to be illuminated just a bit more - it is all completely in shadows and that path would really draw the viewer in more with a bit more light.</td>', 'Golly Karen.  This one is awesome.  I didn''t get to vote on it but I would have given this an 8 or 9.  Stunning control of exposure on the snow, wonderful rich blue sky and excellent framing by the pines. I think my only nitpick is that I would have liked the path to be illuminated just a bit more - it is all completely in shadows and that path would really draw the viewer in more with a bit more light.', '2008-01-08 11:06:41.000000', NULL, 0),
