(4373660, 624746, 44877, '<td valign="top">It''s very arty, Jason - and you know how arty shots do here. I didn''t vote, but I would have given it a 6 - not more because I''m a noise hater. But that''s just a personal preference. I love her serene look and the high light on the face, as well as the whole composition.</td>', 'It''s very arty, Jason - and you know how arty shots do here. I didn''t vote, but I would have given it a 6 - not more because I''m a noise hater. But that''s just a personal preference. I love her serene look and the high light on the face, as well as the whole composition.', '2008-01-08 11:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
