(4373662, 627966, 30982, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus on your subject (the hand and the nose) hurt the score here more than anything else, I suspect.  My problem with it was the imaginary food.  :-)  It looked as though a child was feeding the animal, but there''s nothing there!  I do like the anticipation of the critter - and the fact you can''t see its face.</td>', 'The lack of focus on your subject (the hand and the nose) hurt the score here more than anything else, I suspect.  My problem with it was the imaginary food.  :-)  It looked as though a child was feeding the animal, but there''s nothing there!  I do like the anticipation of the critter - and the fact you can''t see its face.', '2008-01-08 11:11:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373663, 626872, 43774, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 for the scene but you would have gotten more if it hadn''t been overprocessed. It looks a bit noisy in the sky and I can see haloing around the tree on the left.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 for the scene but you would have gotten more if it hadn''t been overprocessed. It looks a bit noisy in the sky and I can see haloing around the tree on the left.', '2008-01-08 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
