(4373672, 623929, 43774, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5. Frankly I do not usually like portraits, especially of kids I do not know. It''s got to be something really special to make me score it higher. I think the eyes could be sharper here as well. For what it''s worth, I gave the blue ribbon winner a 5 as well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 11:14:34.</i></td>', 'I gave this a 5. Frankly I do not usually like portraits, especially of kids I do not know. It''s got to be something really special to make me score it higher. I think the eyes could be sharper here as well. For what it''s worth, I gave the blue ribbon winner a 5 as well.', '2008-01-08 11:14:07.000000', '2008-01-08 11:14:34.000000', 0),
