(4373677, 623531, 44877, '<td valign="top">Now see, I really like this shot. The BW and good contrast are excellent. The composition is different and makes you look - not the smooth stuff we usually see. Me, I like shots that inspire to stop and study for a minute. That said, however, here on DPC, in a Free Study, it was not likely to do better due to what''s generally popular. I would have given it a 7 based on my personal taste.</td>', 'Now see, I really like this shot. The BW and good contrast are excellent. The composition is different and makes you look - not the smooth stuff we usually see. Me, I like shots that inspire to stop and study for a minute. That said, however, here on DPC, in a Free Study, it was not likely to do better due to what''s generally popular. I would have given it a 7 based on my personal taste.', '2008-01-08 11:15:08.000000', NULL, 0),
