(4373718, 626309, 43774, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5. I generally do not like portraits and it has to be something really special for me to vote higher. Wish his head did not fade into the background and the light on his arm seems too bright.</td>', 'I gave this a 5. I generally do not like portraits and it has to be something really special for me to vote higher. Wish his head did not fade into the background and the light on his arm seems too bright.', '2008-01-08 11:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
