(4373733, 627821, 43774, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5. I generally do not like portraits. He doesn''t seem quite in focus, or maybe it just needs sharpening. As for your question, it really doesn''t tell me a story or convey any emotion. He is smiling and looking off somewhere with a fire raging behind him. It looks fake and setup, it does not look like a real fireman at a fire.</td>', 'I gave this a 5. I generally do not like portraits. He doesn''t seem quite in focus, or maybe it just needs sharpening. As for your question, it really doesn''t tell me a story or convey any emotion. He is smiling and looking off somewhere with a fire raging behind him. It looks fake and setup, it does not look like a real fireman at a fire.', '2008-01-08 11:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373735, 628005, 43774, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6....nice scene, not over processed but not much of interest, either. Just nice.</td>', 'I gave this a 6....nice scene, not over processed but not much of interest, either. Just nice.', '2008-01-08 11:25:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373737, 624947, 39427, '<td valign="top">I was wrong :(  awesome shot still</td>', 'I was wrong :(  awesome shot still', '2008-01-08 11:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373739, 626309, 35892, '<td valign="top">i gave this a 5 causeits a look i''ve seen too many times to want to see again---sorry</td>', 'i gave this a 5 causeits a look i''ve seen too many times to want to see again---sorry', '2008-01-08 11:26:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373740, 627124, 44877, '<td valign="top">The mottled light is difficult to work with. Love your bokeh and the colors. I fiddled with it a bit with a levels adjustment layer, which made the colors more defined so the bird stands out more against the background. Some sharpening also helped the bird pop better. I probably would have given it a 5 if I had voted.</td>', 'The mottled light is difficult to work with. Love your bokeh and the colors. I fiddled with it a bit with a levels adjustment layer, which made the colors more defined so the bird stands out more against the background. Some sharpening also helped the bird pop better. I probably would have given it a 5 if I had voted.', '2008-01-08 11:26:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373744, 627229, 43774, '<td valign="top">Whoopsie, I was one of your low voters, I gave this a 3.  When the blur side challenge was going on I met up with Jeffery Levy in Washington, DC when I was on vacation. He was taking part in the side challenge so we talked about it. I told him I hated blur and did not see the reason behind it 99% of the time. That goes for this photo, sorry.</td>', 'Whoopsie, I was one of your low voters, I gave this a 3.  When the blur side challenge was going on I met up with Jeffery Levy in Washington, DC when I was on vacation. He was taking part in the side challenge so we talked about it. I told him I hated blur and did not see the reason behind it 99% of the time. That goes for this photo, sorry.', '2008-01-08 11:27:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373746, 627764, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is so adorable! Underrated I think</td>', 'This is so adorable! Underrated I think', '2008-01-08 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373747, 627966, 43774, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 3. I think if I could see more of the face, even the eyes of the goat I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'I gave this a 3. I think if I could see more of the face, even the eyes of the goat I would have scored it higher.', '2008-01-08 11:28:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373751, 627821, 35892, '<td valign="top">i gave you a 6 cause to me it looks like you have a firefighter at a fire and your trying to do a portrate if it had been some type of action shot i probably would have scored it higher</td>', 'i gave you a 6 cause to me it looks like you have a firefighter at a fire and your trying to do a portrate if it had been some type of action shot i probably would have scored it higher', '2008-01-08 11:28:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373753, 627896, 44877, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in this shot. But I can tell you from experience (most recently with my bombed Free Study entry) that when you go with what other people like it''s going to end badly - (tongue in cheek here). Meaning... you lose your objectivity and that generally brings the lower score with it. That said, I would have given this a 5 for a decent photo with not a lot of wow.</td>', 'I like the tones in this shot. But I can tell you from experience (most recently with my bombed Free Study entry) that when you go with what other people like it''s going to end badly - (tongue in cheek here). Meaning... you lose your objectivity and that generally brings the lower score with it. That said, I would have given this a 5 for a decent photo with not a lot of wow.', '2008-01-08 11:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373759, 628005, 35892, '<td valign="top">like this --must be a guy thing -gave you a 6 though i thought it was a bit plain looking</td>', 'like this --must be a guy thing -gave you a 6 though i thought it was a bit plain looking', '2008-01-08 11:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373764, 627086, 44877, '<td valign="top">It''s an excellent photo and scored fairly well for a FS. I would have given it a 6, had I voted.</td>', 'It''s an excellent photo and scored fairly well for a FS. I would have given it a 6, had I voted.', '2008-01-08 11:30:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373772, 627766, 44877, '<td valign="top">I absolutely adore this shot and would have given it an 8, had I voted. I feel the simplicity and elegance of the composition is excellent. Clearly underrated and great material for a Posthumous ribbon, in my opinion. (Too centered... to shmentered - people need to get over that. Sometimes centered is appropriate, as in this case.)</td>', 'I absolutely adore this shot and would have given it an 8, had I voted. I feel the simplicity and elegance of the composition is excellent. Clearly underrated and great material for a Posthumous ribbon, in my opinion. (Too centered... to shmentered - people need to get over that. Sometimes centered is appropriate, as in this case.)', '2008-01-08 11:33:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373775, 619354, 7889, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot, as you have probably noticed it will not please most of the people here - if it is not sharp and perfectly exposed you will get negative feedback. However there are a good number of people here who look at photos differently and appreciate the efforts of people like yourself.<br/> <br/>Edit to add - dont apologise for your style of photography, shoot how you want to shoot and dont worry what others may say.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 11:37:10.</i></td>', 'I liked this shot, as you have probably noticed it will not please most of the people here - if it is not sharp and perfectly exposed you will get negative feedback. However there are a good number of people here who look at photos differently and appreciate the efforts of people like yourself. Edit to add - dont apologise for your style of photography, shoot how you want to shoot and dont worry what others may say.', '2008-01-08 11:35:38.000000', '2008-01-08 11:37:10.000000', 0),
(4373776, 628012, 44877, '<td valign="top">Well, you scored better than I did. I like it - it''s funky and weird as many of your shots, but in FS it was bound to bomb. Nothing wrong with the image, but it does lack some wow. And FS is all about wow.</td>', 'Well, you scored better than I did. I like it - it''s funky and weird as many of your shots, but in FS it was bound to bomb. Nothing wrong with the image, but it does lack some wow. And FS is all about wow.', '2008-01-08 11:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373777, 627111, 39427, '<td valign="top">gave you a 9, severely underrated imo, the clarity is just exceptional and your control over the whites is also great.</td>', 'gave you a 9, severely underrated imo, the clarity is just exceptional and your control over the whites is also great.', '2008-01-08 11:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
