(4373821, 624303, 39427, '<td valign="top">Yeah I thought this was Ben.  I have to say that your slightly ''non-traditional'' style may not always fare well with voters on this site, but it will still be appreciated by many.  Great shot</td>', 'Yeah I thought this was Ben.  I have to say that your slightly ''non-traditional'' style may not always fare well with voters on this site, but it will still be appreciated by many.  Great shot', '2008-01-08 11:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
