(4373856, 619354, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome image. Very arty and inspired. I''m not fond of the title, but that is minor. Too bad this wasn''t more appreciated.</td>', 'This is an awesome image. Very arty and inspired. I''m not fond of the title, but that is minor. Too bad this wasn''t more appreciated.', '2008-01-08 11:57:45.000000', NULL, 0),
