(4374134, 621378, 67152, '<td valign="top">What a great shot Judi!  A beautiful baby and a wonderful capture.  I am just not sure about the crop - a bit much space on the left side of the image - maybe a bit closer to remove the pants and to focus on that awesome face.</td>', 'What a great shot Judi!  A beautiful baby and a wonderful capture.  I am just not sure about the crop - a bit much space on the left side of the image - maybe a bit closer to remove the pants and to focus on that awesome face.', '2008-01-08 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
