(4374177, 623247, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot (you already knew I thought that); As for our respective placements, I wonder what would have happened if I hadn''t been "trolled" :P Glad this worked so well for you, it''s a great shot, and a wonderful portrait of your daughter.</td>', 'Excellent shot (you already knew I thought that); As for our respective placements, I wonder what would have happened if I hadn''t been "trolled" :P Glad this worked so well for you, it''s a great shot, and a wonderful portrait of your daughter.', '2008-01-08 13:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
