(4374200, 624746, 9462, '<td valign="top">Wow, you were dead on with your prediction. That''s quite amazing... maybe next time I''ll just send you what I think I should submit and you tell me your prediction.<br/> <br/>A 6 from me. She reminds me of a human version of a dream catcher. There''s nothing I can say that hasn''t already been said except for maybe that I shoulda given this a 7.</td>', 'Wow, you were dead on with your prediction. That''s quite amazing... maybe next time I''ll just send you what I think I should submit and you tell me your prediction. A 6 from me. She reminds me of a human version of a dream catcher. There''s nothing I can say that hasn''t already been said except for maybe that I shoulda given this a 7.', '2008-01-08 13:52:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374207, 627904, 78196, '<td valign="top">This one''s a stunner. The vastness of the composition highlights the vulnerability and fragility of the child in an extraordinary way.</td>', 'This one''s a stunner. The vastness of the composition highlights the vulnerability and fragility of the child in an extraordinary way.', '2008-01-08 13:54:45.000000', NULL, 0),
