(4374366, 627999, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea. Strange, for some reason I like this better as a thumbnail. Perhaps because I can absorb the scene as a whole more clearly.Good stuff.</td>', 'Very unique idea. Strange, for some reason I like this better as a thumbnail. Perhaps because I can absorb the scene as a whole more clearly.Good stuff.', '2008-01-08 15:06:46.000000', NULL, 0),
