(4374624, 627966, 77192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by figaro:</b></div><hr/><i> A cute shot - you know what the technical issues are but the moment you''ve shared is a nice one. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Can''t add any more than that. It is a lovely moment. I know that non-DPC-ers look at photos with different eyes with the rest of us - it''s sometimes a good thing and sometimes not to ask their opinions ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by figaro: A cute shot - you know what the technical issues are but the moment you''ve shared is a nice one.   Can''t add any more than that. It is a lovely moment. I know that non-DPC-ers look at photos with different eyes with the rest of us - it''s sometimes a good thing and sometimes not to ask their opinions ;-)', '2008-01-08 16:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
