(4374723, 627936, 62318, '<td valign="top">You know how to take shots, nuff said. This is a terrific moment on that special day. I think the composition is wonderful. I might consider cropping out the flowers, but the point here is the expressions which are great. Well you knew this would do poorly. Watch out on that average, ;)</td>', 'You know how to take shots, nuff said. This is a terrific moment on that special day. I think the composition is wonderful. I might consider cropping out the flowers, but the point here is the expressions which are great. Well you knew this would do poorly. Watch out on that average, ;)', '2008-01-08 16:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374733, 623667, 67152, '<td valign="top">I simply loved this shot - the subtle lighting and the softness of the processing really worked well for me.  But I happen to really like a well controlled use of HDR, as you have done here.  Great work!</td>', 'I simply loved this shot - the subtle lighting and the softness of the processing really worked well for me.  But I happen to really like a well controlled use of HDR, as you have done here.  Great work!', '2008-01-08 16:33:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374738, 623531, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love this image, sadly I only gave this a 6. I wouldn''t change a thing. I believe some photos are just not meant to score high on DPC no matter how good they are.</td>', 'Love this image, sadly I only gave this a 6. I wouldn''t change a thing. I believe some photos are just not meant to score high on DPC no matter how good they are.', '2008-01-08 16:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374746, 625540, 32872, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your high score.  I love this image!</td>', 'Congratulations on your high score.  I love this image!', '2008-01-08 16:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374752, 623485, 32872, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your high score. I admire your landscapes so much.. this is simply gorgeous and so crystal-clear-blue.</td>', 'Congratulations on your high score. I admire your landscapes so much.. this is simply gorgeous and so crystal-clear-blue.', '2008-01-08 16:40:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374753, 627455, 63269, '<td valign="top">Glorious! Very beautiful colors.</td>', 'Glorious! Very beautiful colors.', '2008-01-08 16:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374761, 627936, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice job of connecting the dots to make so many different elements fit together and make a strong composition. I think this is one of those emotional entries that just mean more to the photographer than the voter.</td>', 'Nice job of connecting the dots to make so many different elements fit together and make a strong composition. I think this is one of those emotional entries that just mean more to the photographer than the voter.', '2008-01-08 16:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
