(4374771, 624387, 58691, '<td valign="top">I think the DOF is so shallow that no one could identify the water bowl, which by your title, is part of the subject of the image. I like the shallow DOF and the graininess of the image. To me the subject is the heart-shaped collar.<br/> <br/>I did not vote in this challenge, but I probably would''ve rated it a 5.</td>', 'I think the DOF is so shallow that no one could identify the water bowl, which by your title, is part of the subject of the image. I like the shallow DOF and the graininess of the image. To me the subject is the heart-shaped collar. I did not vote in this challenge, but I probably would''ve rated it a 5.', '2008-01-08 16:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374773, 627896, 11769, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure on your cousin. I like this also. Maybe the background looks a little washed out. Nice job though.</td>', 'Perfect exposure on your cousin. I like this also. Maybe the background looks a little washed out. Nice job though.', '2008-01-08 16:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
