(4374827, 626309, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rider:</b></div><hr/><i> i gave this a 5 causeits a look i''ve seen too many times to want to see again---sorry </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>In photos or real life !! ?? Whilst I appreciate you taking the time to comment I am not certain what you mean. Not having a go at you just dont understand where your coming from on this.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by rider: i gave this a 5 causeits a look i''ve seen too many times to want to see again---sorry   In photos or real life !! ?? Whilst I appreciate you taking the time to comment I am not certain what you mean. Not having a go at you just dont understand where your coming from on this. Mike', '2008-01-08 17:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374832, 626309, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KarenNfld:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave this a 5. I generally do not like portraits and it has to be something really special for me to vote higher. Wish his head did not fade into the background and the light on his arm seems too bright. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeh the sleve of his shirt was brighter than I wanted but I could not darken it anymore or I would have lost detail from his face and the rest of his shirt - sort of compromise. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 17:25:09.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by KarenNfld: I gave this a 5. I generally do not like portraits and it has to be something really special for me to vote higher. Wish his head did not fade into the background and the light on his arm seems too bright.   Yeh the sleve of his shirt was brighter than I wanted but I could not darken it anymore or I would have lost detail from his face and the rest of his shirt - sort of compromise. ', '2008-01-08 17:19:16.000000', '2008-01-08 17:25:09.000000', 0),
