(4374887, 627043, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. Really don''t understand how it could''ve received an under 5 score :-( I like the way she''s looking at the camera, and that the eye closest to the camera is nice and clear. She has beautiful eyes and a great expression. I didn''t vote, but if I had, I think this would''ve got a 7 from me.</td>', 'I like this very much. Really don''t understand how it could''ve received an under 5 score :-( I like the way she''s looking at the camera, and that the eye closest to the camera is nice and clear. She has beautiful eyes and a great expression. I didn''t vote, but if I had, I think this would''ve got a 7 from me.', '2008-01-08 17:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374889, 627639, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice one. 7. Composition and color are very nice.</td>', 'Nice one. 7. Composition and color are very nice.', '2008-01-08 17:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374891, 628012, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ok this was fairly surreal, which can do well (but generally doesn''t) in the challenges.  From my point of view although it made me do a slight double take when it came up on screen during marking overall it seemed a little washed out (pardon the pun) and the light was a little harsh.  Very nice sharpness.  I am not sure whether the uneven border did it any favours</td>', 'Ok this was fairly surreal, which can do well (but generally doesn''t) in the challenges.  From my point of view although it made me do a slight double take when it came up on screen during marking overall it seemed a little washed out (pardon the pun) and the light was a little harsh.  Very nice sharpness.  I am not sure whether the uneven border did it any favours', '2008-01-08 17:39:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374903, 626050, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well I scored this a six.  I cant quite understamd why it only scored 5.36.  <br/> <br/>It is sharp, well composed and the colours grab your attention.<br/> <br/>Two thoughts...One maybe feel it was overprocessed and verging on digital art (I am not one of those people but I could see how the misconception could be made).  Secondly, we seem to have had a surfeit of single leaf shots in recent weeks, a lot of these have not been as good as this but some have possibly been better.  Sometimes when a subject is feel to have been overdone people fail to get the wow factor of the shot<br/> <br/>I thought this was an excellent shot though and one I would have loved to take</td>', 'Well I scored this a six.  I cant quite understamd why it only scored 5.36.   It is sharp, well composed and the colours grab your attention. Two thoughts...One maybe feel it was overprocessed and verging on digital art (I am not one of those people but I could see how the misconception could be made).  Secondly, we seem to have had a surfeit of single leaf shots in recent weeks, a lot of these have not been as good as this but some have possibly been better.  Sometimes when a subject is feel to have been overdone people fail to get the wow factor of the shot I thought this was an excellent shot though and one I would have loved to take', '2008-01-08 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374907, 627821, 11769, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m in a confessional. I gave this wonderful portrait a 5. What was I thinking.<br/>I guess I didn''t like the title, sorry. :(</td>', 'I feel like I''m in a confessional. I gave this wonderful portrait a 5. What was I thinking.I guess I didn''t like the title, sorry. :(', '2008-01-08 17:46:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374916, 626489, 34938, '<td valign="top">Congrats Manny...great to share the front page with someone like you</td>', 'Congrats Manny...great to share the front page with someone like you', '2008-01-08 17:49:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374917, 628005, 11769, '<td valign="top">6 from me. Not having a point of interest hurt this but nice one anyway.</td>', '6 from me. Not having a point of interest hurt this but nice one anyway.', '2008-01-08 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
