(4374939, 623485, 34938, '<td valign="top">Gave this a 10 and thought it would ribbon. Definitly a ribbon contender Doc...your landscape images are the best I have seen. Well done Jason</td>', 'Gave this a 10 and thought it would ribbon. Definitly a ribbon contender Doc...your landscape images are the best I have seen. Well done Jason', '2008-01-08 17:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374945, 627966, 11769, '<td valign="top">If you cropped the post on the left this would come together nicely.</td>', 'If you cropped the post on the left this would come together nicely.', '2008-01-08 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374950, 627766, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK let me be honest...I gave this a four and in retrospect I do think I was too harsh on it (sorry).  There is a lot to like about this image, the centred composition, the ripples from the swans body.  My ''problems'' with it when I was marking it is that I found even when I looked at it quite closely although I knew it was a swan/seabird I could not really make out what was happening in the shot which was a bit unnerving and unattractive to the eye.  Also because the animal seems to be mid moult the darkness of its feathers seems to blend in a bit with the surface of the water making it a touch flat and indistinct<br/> <br/>Having said that I think that many people looking at this a second time would say it was worthy of a higher score than it had been given</td>', 'OK let me be honest...I gave this a four and in retrospect I do think I was too harsh on it (sorry).  There is a lot to like about this image, the centred composition, the ripples from the swans body.  My ''problems'' with it when I was marking it is that I found even when I looked at it quite closely although I knew it was a swan/seabird I could not really make out what was happening in the shot which was a bit unnerving and unattractive to the eye.  Also because the animal seems to be mid moult the darkness of its feathers seems to blend in a bit with the surface of the water making it a touch flat and indistinct Having said that I think that many people looking at this a second time would say it was worthy of a higher score than it had been given', '2008-01-08 17:57:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374957, 625540, 34938, '<td valign="top">Oliver, this is a fantastic image! Congrats on 9th place in a HUGE challenge. Looks like you, me and Tim have to battle it out this year!<br/> <br/>Thanks for all of your fantastic comments and support. You are an exceptional person and photographer...</td>', 'Oliver, this is a fantastic image! Congrats on 9th place in a HUGE challenge. Looks like you, me and Tim have to battle it out this year! Thanks for all of your fantastic comments and support. You are an exceptional person and photographer...', '2008-01-08 17:58:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374967, 624367, 34938, '<td valign="top">Wow! Jaime...awesome image...wish those eyes were in colour somehow, but I don''t think selective desate would work for this. I guess they just add to the image so powerfully as they are...great work...and thanks for all your great comments of late. Enzo</td>', 'Wow! Jaime...awesome image...wish those eyes were in colour somehow, but I don''t think selective desate would work for this. I guess they just add to the image so powerfully as they are...great work...and thanks for all your great comments of late. Enzo', '2008-01-08 18:00:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374972, 626287, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love your lighting in this Alex...fantastic, brooding sky...awesome work as usual. Congrats on 13th place in a huge challenge</td>', 'I love your lighting in this Alex...fantastic, brooding sky...awesome work as usual. Congrats on 13th place in a huge challenge', '2008-01-08 18:01:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374980, 626926, 34938, '<td valign="top">Should have known this was you Lesley...what an amazing image that should have finished at least in the top 10</td>', 'Should have known this was you Lesley...what an amazing image that should have finished at least in the top 10', '2008-01-08 18:03:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374987, 620405, 34938, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image Tim...is that one of your kids in disguise? :)</td>', 'Beautiful image Tim...is that one of your kids in disguise? :)', '2008-01-08 18:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374996, 627966, 68035, '<td valign="top">Alicia<br/> <br/>OK I will be honest and say that I did not like this shot very much.  IMO there is always a bit of a risk in taking an abstracty/humourous shot like this in that unless it is excuted perfectly then there is a chance that it will not do very well and (again imo) the focus is slightly off on the fingers and the goats mouth (which is the key element of the shot).  In a free study especially when there is normally such a plethora of overwhelming images ones with even a slight ''error'' get far lower marks than they would normally do<br/> <br/>Having said all that I do think the idea was great and I did like the framing of the image<br/> <br/></td>', 'Alicia OK I will be honest and say that I did not like this shot very much.  IMO there is always a bit of a risk in taking an abstracty/humourous shot like this in that unless it is excuted perfectly then there is a chance that it will not do very well and (again imo) the focus is slightly off on the fingers and the goats mouth (which is the key element of the shot).  In a free study especially when there is normally such a plethora of overwhelming images ones with even a slight ''error'' get far lower marks than they would normally do Having said all that I do think the idea was great and I did like the framing of the image ', '2008-01-08 18:06:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375004, 622456, 58247, '<td valign="top">The focus on this is just fine to me as are the colors, but I have one big problem with it, there is no face. Without the face, there is really nothing key to focus on. Not being a wildlife photographer, I have no idea what this bird is doing, or why it''s in such an awkward position. If it''s face was in the shot, I''d like it much better. Also, the stick right underneath the bird is distracting to me.</td>', 'The focus on this is just fine to me as are the colors, but I have one big problem with it, there is no face. Without the face, there is really nothing key to focus on. Not being a wildlife photographer, I have no idea what this bird is doing, or why it''s in such an awkward position. If it''s face was in the shot, I''d like it much better. Also, the stick right underneath the bird is distracting to me.', '2008-01-08 18:08:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375010, 619368, 58247, '<td valign="top">Quite honestly, bug shots never really do much for me, but technically I find this image to be pretty good. I think a little more DOF would have been beneficial.</td>', 'Quite honestly, bug shots never really do much for me, but technically I find this image to be pretty good. I think a little more DOF would have been beneficial.', '2008-01-08 18:09:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375017, 625361, 68035, '<td valign="top">I can understand why you would have really liked this shot, it is nicely composed and applies the rule of thirds well.  Also to be honest 5.32 is not that ''bad'' in a free study when scoring tends to be very harsh<br/> <br/>IMO perhaps the thing that it is lacking is a real wow facor.  the sky is great but in terms of the building itself (the key element of the shot) the dusk has made it seem a little flat and whilst it certainly isnt lost in the frame neither does it really scream out look at me.<br/> <br/>I think in a themed challenge this would have scored higher (top 5''s low 6''s) but in a free study when there are so many breathtaking images it was good but not great</td>', 'I can understand why you would have really liked this shot, it is nicely composed and applies the rule of thirds well.  Also to be honest 5.32 is not that ''bad'' in a free study when scoring tends to be very harsh IMO perhaps the thing that it is lacking is a real wow facor.  the sky is great but in terms of the building itself (the key element of the shot) the dusk has made it seem a little flat and whilst it certainly isnt lost in the frame neither does it really scream out look at me. I think in a themed challenge this would have scored higher (top 5''s low 6''s) but in a free study when there are so many breathtaking images it was good but not great', '2008-01-08 18:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375020, 620911, 58247, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think this is a great shot and well processed. I love the duotone that you did. I think this is a 6+ image.</td>', 'Personally, I think this is a great shot and well processed. I love the duotone that you did. I think this is a 6+ image.', '2008-01-08 18:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375026, 627253, 58247, '<td valign="top">Much like my shot, the score you got baffles me too.  Technically I think this shot is spot on, although I am bothered by the overall orange look to the image. I don''t know if that was intentional or not, but for me it''s not working. However, that in now way leads me to believe that the low 5.2 score is justified. I also think a slight vignette would have really helped to draw the viewers eyes more to the subjects face. But here eyes do that so well anyways so perhaps I''m wrong on that one. ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 18:19:48.</i></td>', 'Much like my shot, the score you got baffles me too.  Technically I think this shot is spot on, although I am bothered by the overall orange look to the image. I don''t know if that was intentional or not, but for me it''s not working. However, that in now way leads me to believe that the low 5.2 score is justified. I also think a slight vignette would have really helped to draw the viewers eyes more to the subjects face. But here eyes do that so well anyways so perhaps I''m wrong on that one. ;-)', '2008-01-08 18:17:41.000000', '2008-01-08 18:19:48.000000', 0),
(4375053, 627086, 58247, '<td valign="top">Ok to be honest, this image does nothing for me. But I''m sure that has more to do with my personal taste than anything else. The rainbow sky effect isn''t to my liking and I don''t like how the tree is kind of a silhouette, but not really. I''d like it to either be one, or not. But hey, your image scored waaaay better than mine so that should tell you how much of my opinion you should value. ;-)</td>', 'Ok to be honest, this image does nothing for me. But I''m sure that has more to do with my personal taste than anything else. The rainbow sky effect isn''t to my liking and I don''t like how the tree is kind of a silhouette, but not really. I''d like it to either be one, or not. But hey, your image scored waaaay better than mine so that should tell you how much of my opinion you should value. ;-)', '2008-01-08 18:25:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375069, 627704, 68035, '<td valign="top">Michelle <br/> <br/>well this got a six from me.  I loved the title which really went with this lovely B&amp;W shot.  The low key was great and I thought the image itself was wonderful with the way the light was playing on the leaves.<br/> <br/>Simple and super, great bokeh too</td>', 'Michelle  well this got a six from me.  I loved the title which really went with this lovely B&W shot.  The low key was great and I thought the image itself was wonderful with the way the light was playing on the leaves. Simple and super, great bokeh too', '2008-01-08 18:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375075, 621180, 11769, '<td valign="top">5 from me to. Snow in sunlight is perfect for blown highlights. Interesting image with potential but as is...<br/>I only got a 4.7 so what do I know?</td>', '5 from me to. Snow in sunlight is perfect for blown highlights. Interesting image with potential but as is...I only got a 4.7 so what do I know?', '2008-01-08 18:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375078, 625574, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well I love this shot, great textures and it has a real 3d feel to it.  I thought the browns of the plant were really brought out by the light bokeh.  Stunned that this scored less than 5.</td>', 'Well I love this shot, great textures and it has a real 3d feel to it.  I thought the browns of the plant were really brought out by the light bokeh.  Stunned that this scored less than 5.', '2008-01-08 18:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375079, 627748, 11769, '<td valign="top">Great expression.</td>', 'Great expression.', '2008-01-08 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375085, 624387, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the collar. Very abstract with the shapes. I like it.</td>', 'Love the collar. Very abstract with the shapes. I like it.', '2008-01-08 18:33:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375091, 626872, 68035, '<td valign="top">5.71?  Your having a laugh, in a free study when there were so many great landscapes I thought that this beat the vast majority of them into a cocked hat<br/> <br/>Brilliant reflection and I love the cloud touching the top of the mountain<br/> <br/>Just to prove that you can never please all the people all the time I thought the high contrast really gave the shot some bite and feel it would have lost something without it</td>', '5.71?  Your having a laugh, in a free study when there were so many great landscapes I thought that this beat the vast majority of them into a cocked hat Brilliant reflection and I love the cloud touching the top of the mountain Just to prove that you can never please all the people all the time I thought the high contrast really gave the shot some bite and feel it would have lost something without it', '2008-01-08 18:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375099, 620872, 68035, '<td valign="top">A really nice festive shot and I like the fact that amidst all the noise and action someone found the necessity to make a text call (actually let me change that comment...I despair of the fact that he made the text but I love the fact that you captured it)<br/> <br/>A super slice of life shot</td>', 'A really nice festive shot and I like the fact that amidst all the noise and action someone found the necessity to make a text call (actually let me change that comment...I despair of the fact that he made the text but I love the fact that you captured it) A super slice of life shot', '2008-01-08 18:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375100, 626113, 73564, '<td valign="top">Very Nice! I love the tones, and the composition and path are great.</td>', 'Very Nice! I love the tones, and the composition and path are great.', '2008-01-08 18:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375105, 624367, 73564, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful! Great work</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful! Great work', '2008-01-08 18:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375112, 625906, 73564, '<td valign="top">Love the pastel colors, great work.</td>', 'Love the pastel colors, great work.', '2008-01-08 18:39:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375117, 622190, 73564, '<td valign="top">NICE! Looks authentic, great work!</td>', 'NICE! Looks authentic, great work!', '2008-01-08 18:40:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375123, 623531, 68035, '<td valign="top">I really liked the point of view of this shot and thought that the black and white conversion was strong enough to give the shot pop but not so harsh that it overpowered the intrinsic softeness of the dogs fur<br/> <br/>Really nice composition as well, sadly one of those shots that gets lost in a free study because it is not brightly coloured enough<br/> <br/>A thing of gentle beauty</td>', 'I really liked the point of view of this shot and thought that the black and white conversion was strong enough to give the shot pop but not so harsh that it overpowered the intrinsic softeness of the dogs fur Really nice composition as well, sadly one of those shots that gets lost in a free study because it is not brightly coloured enough A thing of gentle beauty', '2008-01-08 18:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375134, 627253, 19708, '<td valign="top"><a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=723750" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Linked to discussion</a></td>', 'Linked to discussion', '2008-01-08 18:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375158, 620358, 20941, '<td valign="top">Awesome Work!! Congratulations on the ribbon and a very cool image</td>', 'Awesome Work!! Congratulations on the ribbon and a very cool image', '2008-01-08 19:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375167, 626327, 20941, '<td valign="top">What a lovely composition for this sweet image! Good eye for a beautiful scene! Congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'What a lovely composition for this sweet image! Good eye for a beautiful scene! Congrats on the ribbon', '2008-01-08 19:02:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375175, 626489, 20941, '<td valign="top">Always a pleasure to see your fantastic work and this is no exception. Congratulations on the Blue and a powerful image</td>', 'Always a pleasure to see your fantastic work and this is no exception. Congratulations on the Blue and a powerful image', '2008-01-08 19:06:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375182, 627253, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 in voting. The orange cast bothered me and there seemed to be some odd texture as the focus drops off. Pleasing comp, nice gaze and nice smile. Not a DPC WOW image but not a stinker either.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 in voting. The orange cast bothered me and there seemed to be some odd texture as the focus drops off. Pleasing comp, nice gaze and nice smile. Not a DPC WOW image but not a stinker either.', '2008-01-08 19:11:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375185, 627748, 70270, '<td valign="top">I loved this shot ... it was one of my 10s.  The funny expression on  her face just makes the shot, and the processing nicely accentuates the overall feel of the image.  I was one of your two 10s.  I could easily see this on one of those funny, arty greeting cards.</td>', 'I loved this shot ... it was one of my 10s.  The funny expression on  her face just makes the shot, and the processing nicely accentuates the overall feel of the image.  I was one of your two 10s.  I could easily see this on one of those funny, arty greeting cards.', '2008-01-08 19:12:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375197, 627821, 70270, '<td valign="top">I also gave it a 5, and I remember why.  There was something about his stance and his smile that made it LOOK a bit off to me, almost as if it were a posed picture.  His expression just didn''t seem to fit with the scene ... burning building in the background and he''s sitting there posing for GQ.  That was my true emotional response to the image ... whether posed or not really doesn''t matter to me, its just that he appeared so out of context with his surroundings that I didn''t like it.  You''ll have to be the judge as to whether that''s a reaction to the photo or your subject.  ;&gt;P</td>', 'I also gave it a 5, and I remember why.  There was something about his stance and his smile that made it LOOK a bit off to me, almost as if it were a posed picture.  His expression just didn''t seem to fit with the scene ... burning building in the background and he''s sitting there posing for GQ.  That was my true emotional response to the image ... whether posed or not really doesn''t matter to me, its just that he appeared so out of context with his surroundings that I didn''t like it.  You''ll have to be the judge as to whether that''s a reaction to the photo or your subject.  ;>P', '2008-01-08 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375214, 620872, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like the moment of capture, but the technicals brought it down for me ... in particular, I thought the main subject was too dark in comparison to the tuba (trombone!) players in the far background.  A tighter focus or crop on just him and the guy behind him might have fixed that, and also eliminated some of the dead space and distracting elements on the left.  With just those two subjects you have a nice tight composition, and a great juxtposition between the guy madly texting on his phone and the other emphatically oom pah pah ing on his horn.</td>', 'I like the moment of capture, but the technicals brought it down for me ... in particular, I thought the main subject was too dark in comparison to the tuba (trombone!) players in the far background.  A tighter focus or crop on just him and the guy behind him might have fixed that, and also eliminated some of the dead space and distracting elements on the left.  With just those two subjects you have a nice tight composition, and a great juxtposition between the guy madly texting on his phone and the other emphatically oom pah pah ing on his horn.', '2008-01-08 19:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375247, 625646, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the forms you went with. The different lines are nice. The reflections are a bit bright, I think in this case a polarize mihgt have helped. That is a spectacular wave you managed to capture.</td>', 'I like the forms you went with. The different lines are nice. The reflections are a bit bright, I think in this case a polarize mihgt have helped. That is a spectacular wave you managed to capture.', '2008-01-08 19:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375248, 627253, 50695, '<td valign="top">the skin color seems off, doesn''t seem natural. and the shallow DOF, which normally would work well, only emphasizes this strange color and makes it seem almost like a glow. Something as simple as a photo filter could probably do wonders for this image.</td>', 'the skin color seems off, doesn''t seem natural. and the shallow DOF, which normally would work well, only emphasizes this strange color and makes it seem almost like a glow. Something as simple as a photo filter could probably do wonders for this image.', '2008-01-08 19:57:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375266, 627640, 31403, '<td valign="top">This is YOURS!!!  Who would have guessed!  I love it!<br/> <br/>Look at those micro drops on the surface to the right - so very cool.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 20:52:42.</i></td>', 'This is YOURS!!!  Who would have guessed!  I love it! Look at those micro drops on the surface to the right - so very cool.  ', '2008-01-08 20:07:13.000000', '2008-01-08 20:52:42.000000', 0),
(4375293, 627124, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think the movement is wonderful. I will agree with Deb below, if you cut off the top I think it will make for a much better shot. The reason is you get the highlights out of the top. The highlight on the bottom are terrific especially since they mimic the bird''s shape. I gave you a five in the challenge, so a bit better than your score, but it would socre a 6 or 7 I think if the top might have been cropped out. Good find nonetheless.</td>', 'I think the movement is wonderful. I will agree with Deb below, if you cut off the top I think it will make for a much better shot. The reason is you get the highlights out of the top. The highlight on the bottom are terrific especially since they mimic the bird''s shape. I gave you a five in the challenge, so a bit better than your score, but it would socre a 6 or 7 I think if the top might have been cropped out. Good find nonetheless.', '2008-01-08 20:19:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375301, 627985, 54885, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. I think it is hard nowdays to find a portrait that really looks like something that is not over processed with a computer and this portrait is an excellent example of not being overprocessed. This photo looks like a photo what one would see with out the camera.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. I think it is hard nowdays to find a portrait that really looks like something that is not over processed with a computer and this portrait is an excellent example of not being overprocessed. This photo looks like a photo what one would see with out the camera.', '2008-01-08 20:23:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375306, 627896, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think the portrait part itself is marvelous. I think the issue is with the background. The reason isn''t the processing but the frame the child is in. I think either starting at the horizon or just including would have helped. I''m not good with portraits myself, so this is just a guess. <br/> <br/>Still it is a terrific moment and something to be happy for.</td>', 'I think the portrait part itself is marvelous. I think the issue is with the background. The reason isn''t the processing but the frame the child is in. I think either starting at the horizon or just including would have helped. I''m not good with portraits myself, so this is just a guess.  Still it is a terrific moment and something to be happy for.', '2008-01-08 20:26:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375311, 627766, 62318, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I thought I commented during the challenge. I really like the tones here and the ripples. The interesting pose of the duck also works extremely well. It all leads up to a good picture. My only suggestion and it is quite minor would be to brighten up the duck just a bit while keeping the same contrast (I would like to see more of those whites).</td>', 'Hmmm, I thought I commented during the challenge. I really like the tones here and the ripples. The interesting pose of the duck also works extremely well. It all leads up to a good picture. My only suggestion and it is quite minor would be to brighten up the duck just a bit while keeping the same contrast (I would like to see more of those whites).', '2008-01-08 20:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375313, 619543, 9668, '<td valign="top">How did you edit this then?</td>', 'How did you edit this then?', '2008-01-08 20:30:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375319, 628012, 62318, '<td valign="top">I thought the idea was fairly interesting. It is a good study on textures and shapes.I think the exposure is good, maybe just a bit brighter. However, for me at least I find the scene a bit odd...why is there a cactus on the washer? It creates a very unreal photo, BUT I really like the geometrics quite a bit!</td>', 'I thought the idea was fairly interesting. It is a good study on textures and shapes.I think the exposure is good, maybe just a bit brighter. However, for me at least I find the scene a bit odd...why is there a cactus on the washer? It creates a very unreal photo, BUT I really like the geometrics quite a bit!', '2008-01-08 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375326, 620911, 62318, '<td valign="top">Well this is gorgeous. Going into favs. This is the type of stuff I like. The only suggestion might be to reduce the blues a bit. I always feel blue and ice go together well, blue and snow not nearly so. Still love the overall shot.</td>', 'Well this is gorgeous. Going into favs. This is the type of stuff I like. The only suggestion might be to reduce the blues a bit. I always feel blue and ice go together well, blue and snow not nearly so. Still love the overall shot.', '2008-01-08 20:35:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375328, 623929, 62318, '<td valign="top">Well, people here always like when the subject looks into the camera. However, I think this shot would have lost a lot of it''s charm if there where the case. I think the pose is perfect. Only suggestion is the focus seems to be on the hair rather than the eyes. But it is quite minor. Very fun portrait.</td>', 'Well, people here always like when the subject looks into the camera. However, I think this shot would have lost a lot of it''s charm if there where the case. I think the pose is perfect. Only suggestion is the focus seems to be on the hair rather than the eyes. But it is quite minor. Very fun portrait.', '2008-01-08 20:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375333, 622456, 62318, '<td valign="top">Well the image definitely pops and the colors and sharpness are spot on. Just have the bird look at you and you would have had a 6+ photo in my opinion. However, as is this is a highly technical shot and you should be applauded. Nice post work too.</td>', 'Well the image definitely pops and the colors and sharpness are spot on. Just have the bird look at you and you would have had a 6+ photo in my opinion. However, as is this is a highly technical shot and you should be applauded. Nice post work too.', '2008-01-08 20:39:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375339, 623667, 62318, '<td valign="top">The scene itself is marvelous. a good position of elements and I like the DoF here (or gaussian blur...). I think there is just a tad too much contrast and darkness in the clouds, more of the original type clouds but everything else as is.</td>', 'The scene itself is marvelous. a good position of elements and I like the DoF here (or gaussian blur...). I think there is just a tad too much contrast and darkness in the clouds, more of the original type clouds but everything else as is.', '2008-01-08 20:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375340, 624387, 70369, '<td valign="top">yep.. from about 4 feet away, it makes perfect sense... I could appreciate the lines and the color so much more then the 1 1/2 feet I sit from the screen..</td>', 'yep.. from about 4 feet away, it makes perfect sense... I could appreciate the lines and the color so much more then the 1 1/2 feet I sit from the screen..', '2008-01-08 20:43:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375343, 627043, 1024, '<td valign="top">I gave  this a 5 after looking at it for a long time.  The OOF arm that seems to be coming out of her chin was just more that I could handle.  That and the fact that she is looking at you from such an uncomfortable angle.</td>', 'I gave  this a 5 after looking at it for a long time.  The OOF arm that seems to be coming out of her chin was just more that I could handle.  That and the fact that she is looking at you from such an uncomfortable angle.', '2008-01-08 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375357, 620358, 31606, '<td valign="top">Should have placed First in my opinion.  I did not vote in this challenge but when I scanned the photos I saw this one and my first thought was it will get blue.</td>', 'Should have placed First in my opinion.  I did not vote in this challenge but when I scanned the photos I saw this one and my first thought was it will get blue.', '2008-01-08 20:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375358, 627043, 48697, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote but I would have given this a 6. I like the photo but do think the face is a bit bright/washed out and the arm does distract as well. Seems that it could have been a bit sharper or used a bit more DOF.  I do like the vignetteing as it really focuses you on her face and her look is nice.</td>', 'I didn''t vote but I would have given this a 6. I like the photo but do think the face is a bit bright/washed out and the arm does distract as well. Seems that it could have been a bit sharper or used a bit more DOF.  I do like the vignetteing as it really focuses you on her face and her look is nice.', '2008-01-08 20:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375374, 627043, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think the overall DoF is terrific. If both eyes would have been in focus I think you would have nailed it. I am not sure about the arm, as you don''t get to see the hand. I think seeing the whole hand would have improved the image. However, I still think it is a very stunning shot. The colors are terrific and the engagement of the subject is wonderful. I gave you a six in the challenge.<br/> <br/>I think this was the case of the autopilot 5 voting going on with the occasion 4 to bring down the average. A shame.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 20:57:39.</i></td>', 'I think the overall DoF is terrific. If both eyes would have been in focus I think you would have nailed it. I am not sure about the arm, as you don''t get to see the hand. I think seeing the whole hand would have improved the image. However, I still think it is a very stunning shot. The colors are terrific and the engagement of the subject is wonderful. I gave you a six in the challenge. I think this was the case of the autopilot 5 voting going on with the occasion 4 to bring down the average. A shame.', '2008-01-08 20:56:47.000000', '2008-01-08 20:57:39.000000', 0),
(4375383, 626050, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very nice color contrast. I also like how the leaf seems to float above the snow. Very interesting angle for a very typical isolation shot. Post might be a little over done as it appears metallic, but maybe that was the intention? Gave you a 6 in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice color contrast. I also like how the leaf seems to float above the snow. Very interesting angle for a very typical isolation shot. Post might be a little over done as it appears metallic, but maybe that was the intention? Gave you a 6 in the challenge.', '2008-01-08 20:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375389, 626006, 64994, '<td valign="top">Well you missed the 5.2, but I like it and if you like it thats what really important...I think a less centered comp would have helped the score, but thats just my opinian...<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Well you missed the 5.2, but I like it and if you like it thats what really important...I think a less centered comp would have helped the score, but thats just my opinian... Jack', '2008-01-08 20:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375396, 625361, 62318, '<td valign="top">The problem with this shot it is too small to really enjoy all the details. As such it is very easy to over look the details, especially considering the frenzy of FS voting. I might have cropped off the right a bit, but that would be about it.<br/> <br/>A shot that suffers from the 640 rez.</td>', 'The problem with this shot it is too small to really enjoy all the details. As such it is very easy to over look the details, especially considering the frenzy of FS voting. I might have cropped off the right a bit, but that would be about it. A shot that suffers from the 640 rez.', '2008-01-08 21:01:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375398, 627043, 28359, '<td valign="top">Portraits are tough in Free Study challenge, It really needs to be creative and stand out. Things I like about the shot is the Dof. The face and eye closest to you is sharp than fades out of focus. The eyes are well done. Dislikes are the lighting on the face is kinda flat with no shadows to give it more of a 3d effect. With all that said its a good portrait and I gave it a 6. ..Ace</td>', 'Portraits are tough in Free Study challenge, It really needs to be creative and stand out. Things I like about the shot is the Dof. The face and eye closest to you is sharp than fades out of focus. The eyes are well done. Dislikes are the lighting on the face is kinda flat with no shadows to give it more of a 3d effect. With all that said its a good portrait and I gave it a 6. ..Ace', '2008-01-08 21:01:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375405, 626309, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think there is a bit too much contrast or at least the main focal lighting is on the wrong section (sleeve). However the expression is terrific. I also like how your burned out the distracting background. The textures of the boy''s shirt really work well.A splendid shot overall.</td>', 'I think there is a bit too much contrast or at least the main focal lighting is on the wrong section (sleeve). However the expression is terrific. I also like how your burned out the distracting background. The textures of the boy''s shirt really work well.A splendid shot overall.', '2008-01-08 21:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375416, 627821, 62318, '<td valign="top">Technicals are terrific. I like the composition as a whole. This is one time where I feel the eyes are incorrect as they neither are engaged with the viewer or the enivornment as such it kind of takes you out of the moment. While I like the simple expression, I think it kind of takes aways from the moment.</td>', 'Technicals are terrific. I like the composition as a whole. This is one time where I feel the eyes are incorrect as they neither are engaged with the viewer or the enivornment as such it kind of takes you out of the moment. While I like the simple expression, I think it kind of takes aways from the moment.', '2008-01-08 21:08:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375430, 628005, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like the vertical lines, hopefully that was the intent. I think there maybe a few too many. I also think the light is a bit too even to bring any depth to the photo. STill I like the intent and the mix of natural elements works well.</td>', 'I really like the vertical lines, hopefully that was the intent. I think there maybe a few too many. I also think the light is a bit too even to bring any depth to the photo. STill I like the intent and the mix of natural elements works well.', '2008-01-08 21:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375458, 627229, 62318, '<td valign="top">The blur is terrific. Even if you would have gotten it sharp, difficult for the DPC crowd. My only suggestion would maybe to crop just a bit off the right and to increase the contrast. Even without that, the shot is stunning and considering the conditions even more rewarding.</td>', 'The blur is terrific. Even if you would have gotten it sharp, difficult for the DPC crowd. My only suggestion would maybe to crop just a bit off the right and to increase the contrast. Even without that, the shot is stunning and considering the conditions even more rewarding.', '2008-01-08 21:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375490, 625276, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think a normal shot could easily score well, I don''t think it needs to be HDR for DPC necessarily. I really enjoy most of your shots and this one included. I really like the shadows and details. The exposure is spot on too. I think this one might have been better with a different focal length. Curious what you shot this at, 35mm?<br/> <br/>What I might suggest for the same scene is get close and use a very wide angle to really give a sense of scale to that tree of the right and distance overall. Or go longer (200mm) and back up to a distance where the same scene is laid out above, but now you will a more compress feeling. Right now I feel the image is too clumped together as far as eye movement. But your mileage may vary.<br/> <br/>Just my two cents. I enjoyed the picture and I gave you a 6 during the challenge.</td>', 'I think a normal shot could easily score well, I don''t think it needs to be HDR for DPC necessarily. I really enjoy most of your shots and this one included. I really like the shadows and details. The exposure is spot on too. I think this one might have been better with a different focal length. Curious what you shot this at, 35mm? What I might suggest for the same scene is get close and use a very wide angle to really give a sense of scale to that tree of the right and distance overall. Or go longer (200mm) and back up to a distance where the same scene is laid out above, but now you will a more compress feeling. Right now I feel the image is too clumped together as far as eye movement. But your mileage may vary. Just my two cents. I enjoyed the picture and I gave you a 6 during the challenge.', '2008-01-08 21:26:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375507, 627966, 62318, '<td valign="top">Here are the things I like. I really like the lines. I like the contrast. And I like the exposure. Those things are key. I think you just missed the focus a bit as it is on the front post. I also think if there was something in the fingers it would have helped. Still I like the lines a lot.</td>', 'Here are the things I like. I really like the lines. I like the contrast. And I like the exposure. Those things are key. I think you just missed the focus a bit as it is on the front post. I also think if there was something in the fingers it would have helped. Still I like the lines a lot.', '2008-01-08 21:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375562, 621180, 62318, '<td valign="top">Why is there a bench in the bridge? That is the thing that interests me. I think maybe getting a bit closer and emphasizing that would be cool. RIght now it is is a standard old red bridge picture. In itself it is good, but if you are going to do the ordinary on DPC, they usually expect it as the over-the-top style. Personally, I find the shot good. I gave it a 5 in the challenge, so above the average...</td>', 'Why is there a bench in the bridge? That is the thing that interests me. I think maybe getting a bit closer and emphasizing that would be cool. RIght now it is is a standard old red bridge picture. In itself it is good, but if you are going to do the ordinary on DPC, they usually expect it as the over-the-top style. Personally, I find the shot good. I gave it a 5 in the challenge, so above the average...', '2008-01-08 21:41:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375617, 626489, 69668, '<td valign="top">A emotional image that captivates the viewer.  Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'A emotional image that captivates the viewer.  Congrats on the blue.', '2008-01-08 21:54:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375628, 627748, 62318, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes. The soft effect kind of reminds me of old wedding albums of the 70s/80s. Not sure if that is a good thing. I think the exposure is terrific. Curious what this would look straight out of the camera without the vignette. Adorable child and a picture to remember.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes. The soft effect kind of reminds me of old wedding albums of the 70s/80s. Not sure if that is a good thing. I think the exposure is terrific. Curious what this would look straight out of the camera without the vignette. Adorable child and a picture to remember.', '2008-01-08 21:56:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375649, 627043, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the pose.  I get so bored with the standard "stare ahead at the camera and smile" look.  I didn''t vote on this, but probably would''ve been between 5 and 6.  I do think the arm is quite distracting, her back eye isn''t quite in focus, and I''d like to see a little more contrast in her face.  At the same time, her shirt is too dark - just seems kind of like a black hole below her face.  But I''d bet with a little processing, you could make this much better.  But 4.9 is crazy.<br/> <br/>As always, though, do YOU like it?  Does SHE like it?  Much more important than a DPC score. :)</td>', 'I like the pose.  I get so bored with the standard "stare ahead at the camera and smile" look.  I didn''t vote on this, but probably would''ve been between 5 and 6.  I do think the arm is quite distracting, her back eye isn''t quite in focus, and I''d like to see a little more contrast in her face.  At the same time, her shirt is too dark - just seems kind of like a black hole below her face.  But I''d bet with a little processing, you could make this much better.  But 4.9 is crazy. As always, though, do YOU like it?  Does SHE like it?  Much more important than a DPC score. :)', '2008-01-08 22:02:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375654, 626926, 40797, '<td valign="top">Wow, Lesley- Simply Amazing!!!</td>', 'Wow, Lesley- Simply Amazing!!!', '2008-01-08 22:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375667, 626327, 2333, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, you snagged the red! Kudos to you and to the voters for recognizing a truly well-seen and well executed shot.</td>', 'Ahhh, you snagged the red! Kudos to you and to the voters for recognizing a truly well-seen and well executed shot.', '2008-01-08 22:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375671, 627086, 62318, '<td valign="top">Hey Jeb, I liked your redo of this image as I feel it is more natural. Still just to say it does have wonderful texture and placement of items.</td>', 'Hey Jeb, I liked your redo of this image as I feel it is more natural. Still just to say it does have wonderful texture and placement of items.', '2008-01-08 22:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375674, 624367, 52449, '<td valign="top">Cool--a Top 20 finish! It was close throughout the whole process, but you pulled ahead of me in the homestretch. Congrats!<br/></td>', 'Cool--a Top 20 finish! It was close throughout the whole process, but you pulled ahead of me in the homestretch. Congrats!', '2008-01-08 22:08:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375677, 626926, 11769, '<td valign="top">Sort of a nice shot. 10 from me! Great stuff.</td>', 'Sort of a nice shot. 10 from me! Great stuff.', '2008-01-08 22:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375684, 624492, 51750, '<td valign="top">very elegant</td>', 'very elegant', '2008-01-08 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 0),
