(4375802, 626483, 58728, '<td valign="top">Awesome lines in this image.  I love the high contrast - it gives a great balance to the shot.</td>', 'Awesome lines in this image.  I love the high contrast - it gives a great balance to the shot.', '2008-01-08 22:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375811, 622456, 58728, '<td valign="top">AwEsOME dof!!!  In my opinion, the vignetting is perfect. I  love the deep blue, and I like the fact that we can''t see his face.  Gives more mystery to the pic.</td>', 'AwEsOME dof!!!  In my opinion, the vignetting is perfect. I  love the deep blue, and I like the fact that we can''t see his face.  Gives more mystery to the pic.', '2008-01-08 22:54:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375813, 620358, 28359, '<td valign="top">So creative, I keep coming back to look...Congrats.</td>', 'So creative, I keep coming back to look...Congrats.', '2008-01-08 22:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375815, 627253, 11769, '<td valign="top">Captivating image. The focus is very nice on the eyes. Good contrast and comp, slightly overexposed. The color cast being off hurt this with the scoring I''m sure.</td>', 'Captivating image. The focus is very nice on the eyes. Good contrast and comp, slightly overexposed. The color cast being off hurt this with the scoring I''m sure.', '2008-01-08 22:55:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375818, 624387, 58728, '<td valign="top">WHAT&gt;!&gt;&gt; How on EARTH did this finish in last place?  It is a GEM. The greens and browns and red are all PERFECLY balanced with each other, and the graininess adds so much.  I just love it.</td>', 'WHAT>!>> How on EARTH did this finish in last place?  It is a GEM. The greens and browns and red are all PERFECLY balanced with each other, and the graininess adds so much.  I just love it.', '2008-01-08 22:55:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375835, 621180, 58728, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty good to me.  The only thing that I don''t really like about the photo is the border.  I like the snow, the shadows, the composition...  but hey - my image did bad, so who knows, right?!  :)~Magen</td>', 'Looks pretty good to me.  The only thing that I don''t really like about the photo is the border.  I like the snow, the shadows, the composition...  but hey - my image did bad, so who knows, right?!  :)~Magen', '2008-01-08 23:00:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375839, 624876, 66267, '<td valign="top">This would have scored a lot higher if the male model was easier to see... but still an incredibly underrated image.</td>', 'This would have scored a lot higher if the male model was easier to see... but still an incredibly underrated image.', '2008-01-08 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375841, 627966, 58728, '<td valign="top">Looks like you did the same thing as I did - entered a cute moment in time that you really like, but seems the voters don''t appreciate it as much as we do, right?  I think it''s really cute.  Maybe either a bit MORE blur would have helped?  Either way, it''s cute and funny.  :)</td>', 'Looks like you did the same thing as I did - entered a cute moment in time that you really like, but seems the voters don''t appreciate it as much as we do, right?  I think it''s really cute.  Maybe either a bit MORE blur would have helped?  Either way, it''s cute and funny.  :)', '2008-01-08 23:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375846, 627086, 15305, '<td valign="top">I gave it an 8! I think its a wonderful image. However, the sky does look a little bit strange in my monitor, specially the blue part. I use a LCD monitor and I''ve noticed that images that I processed on CRT monitors and looked great on them looked weird and full of artifacts and blotches on the LCD.<br/>Hope this helps. Regards,<br/> <br/>Roberto</td>', 'I gave it an 8! I think its a wonderful image. However, the sky does look a little bit strange in my monitor, specially the blue part. I use a LCD monitor and I''ve noticed that images that I processed on CRT monitors and looked great on them looked weird and full of artifacts and blotches on the LCD.Hope this helps. Regards, Roberto', '2008-01-08 23:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375847, 627253, 23394, '<td valign="top">personally, i would have cropped it just above the eyebrow on the right and just below the lip, and i would have either toned it bw or duotone.  it''s a nice shot, but you should know by now what scores in a freestudy and what doesn''t ;-)  there''s just nothing there that leaps up and makes you smack your head saying, damn, i wish i had shot that--which is what you have to do if you want to score...</td>', 'personally, i would have cropped it just above the eyebrow on the right and just below the lip, and i would have either toned it bw or duotone.  it''s a nice shot, but you should know by now what scores in a freestudy and what doesn''t ;-)  there''s just nothing there that leaps up and makes you smack your head saying, damn, i wish i had shot that--which is what you have to do if you want to score...', '2008-01-08 23:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375870, 627766, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great image, though I like the ripples and the reflection, I feel that the subject lost importance.</td>', 'Great image, though I like the ripples and the reflection, I feel that the subject lost importance.', '2008-01-08 23:16:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375879, 628012, 15305, '<td valign="top">The idea is not bad to start with, but it lacks the work in setting and lighting to distinguish it from a common snapshot.</td>', 'The idea is not bad to start with, but it lacks the work in setting and lighting to distinguish it from a common snapshot.', '2008-01-08 23:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375889, 626483, 5034, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines, really focus attention on the rails, have to make a cnscious effort to look at the other parts of the photo.  Perhaps if you had shot this from over the other track the "grat beyond" may have been emphasised more.</td>', 'Great leading lines, really focus attention on the rails, have to make a cnscious effort to look at the other parts of the photo.  Perhaps if you had shot this from over the other track the "grat beyond" may have been emphasised more.', '2008-01-08 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375890, 625118, 15305, '<td valign="top">I really liked the contrasts in color and texture, I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I really liked the contrasts in color and texture, I gave it an 8.', '2008-01-08 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375913, 626489, 66602, '<td valign="top">Manny, I like your serious portraits even more than I like your portaits of beautiful women. this is another stunning image.</td>', 'Manny, I like your serious portraits even more than I like your portaits of beautiful women. this is another stunning image.', '2008-01-08 23:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375915, 626872, 15305, '<td valign="top">It is a great image to begin with, but it is too overprocessed to my taste.</td>', 'It is a great image to begin with, but it is too overprocessed to my taste.', '2008-01-08 23:29:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375922, 620911, 15305, '<td valign="top">I think your choice of processing was great for this image, I like it a lot!</td>', 'I think your choice of processing was great for this image, I like it a lot!', '2008-01-08 23:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4375931, 623929, 15305, '<td valign="top">Personally, I''m not into kids shot... Specially messy shots like this one... However, it is a good portrait your child will enjoy in the future. There is something odd in the eyes I can''t exactly point out, but IMHO it takes a lot from the image.</td>', 'Personally, I''m not into kids shot... Specially messy shots like this one... However, it is a good portrait your child will enjoy in the future. There is something odd in the eyes I can''t exactly point out, but IMHO it takes a lot from the image.', '2008-01-08 23:35:21.000000', NULL, 0),
