(4378192, 625118, 36470, '<td valign="top">I would have given this a 6-7.  I LOVE the color and contrast, but the composition is slightly lacking.  Maybe if it was shot so that the rocks came through the frame at an angle it would have improved it?  Who knows :)  The color really is gorgeous.</td>', 'I would have given this a 6-7.  I LOVE the color and contrast, but the composition is slightly lacking.  Maybe if it was shot so that the rocks came through the frame at an angle it would have improved it?  Who knows :)  The color really is gorgeous.', '2008-01-09 15:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378197, 620358, 19831, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot Claire! Congrats :-)</td>', 'Awesome shot Claire! Congrats :-)', '2008-01-09 15:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378210, 627766, 36470, '<td valign="top">I do think it is too centered.  I agree that the ripples are nice, so the centering works great right to left.  Maybe if a little bit of the bottom was cropped it would have a little more punch.<br/> <br/>I honestly wouldn''t have known what this was without reading your description.  I truly think this would have done much better if you could see  the head.  I really like the tone of this photo.  The vignette is a nice, suttle touch as well.</td>', 'I do think it is too centered.  I agree that the ripples are nice, so the centering works great right to left.  Maybe if a little bit of the bottom was cropped it would have a little more punch. I honestly wouldn''t have known what this was without reading your description.  I truly think this would have done much better if you could see  the head.  I really like the tone of this photo.  The vignette is a nice, suttle touch as well.', '2008-01-09 15:12:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378221, 628012, 36470, '<td valign="top">Honestly, the concept does not grab me.  My first instinct was to say HUH?  LOL  I also don''t care for the frame.  I do like the slightly antiqued tone to the photo.</td>', 'Honestly, the concept does not grab me.  My first instinct was to say HUH?  LOL  I also don''t care for the frame.  I do like the slightly antiqued tone to the photo.', '2008-01-09 15:16:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378229, 626872, 36470, '<td valign="top">I do like the scene, but don''t care for the extreme sharpening.  However, I do like it compared to the original.  Makes no sense, huh?  ;)</td>', 'I do like the scene, but don''t care for the extreme sharpening.  However, I do like it compared to the original.  Makes no sense, huh?  ;)', '2008-01-09 15:18:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378243, 621180, 36470, '<td valign="top">It is a beautiful shot.  I think for DPC sakes, more post-processing would have really upped the score.  I hope you don''t mind, but I messed with it a little for fun.  I am not great at post-processing. &lt;---- Disclaimer.  I desaturated the trees a bit, to give more focus to the barn.  Who knows if it would have gotten a higher score or not!  Either way, you have a nice shot.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=630997" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36470/120/630997.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36470/120/630997.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/36470/120/630997.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-09 15:29:29.</i></td>', 'It is a beautiful shot.  I think for DPC sakes, more post-processing would have really upped the score.  I hope you don''t mind, but I messed with it a little for fun.  I am not great at post-processing. <---- Disclaimer.  I desaturated the trees a bit, to give more focus to the barn.  Who knows if it would have gotten a higher score or not!  Either way, you have a nice shot.', '2008-01-09 15:20:25.000000', '2008-01-09 15:29:29.000000', 0),
(4378248, 625646, 58691, '<td valign="top">This needed a few highlights in the dark background areas and it would''ve scored a bit higher. Also, I''m not sure the foreground is necessary. A different crop that accentuated the splash might have been more dramatic.</td>', 'This needed a few highlights in the dark background areas and it would''ve scored a bit higher. Also, I''m not sure the foreground is necessary. A different crop that accentuated the splash might have been more dramatic.', '2008-01-09 15:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378498, 625646, 15305, '<td valign="top">The magnificense of this shot is located in the upper left quadrant, the rest of the image doesn''t add anything to it.  A crop concentrating on the breaking waves would have scored better IMHO.</td>', 'The magnificense of this shot is located in the upper left quadrant, the rest of the image doesn''t add anything to it.  A crop concentrating on the breaking waves would have scored better IMHO.', '2008-01-09 16:23:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378506, 620911, 66267, '<td valign="top">What the hell, this shots amazing. Extremely underrated!<br/> <br/>My only problem is the top of the tree is cut off, but who cares, its still great.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-09 16:29:38.</i></td>', 'What the hell, this shots amazing. Extremely underrated! My only problem is the top of the tree is cut off, but who cares, its still great.', '2008-01-09 16:28:49.000000', '2008-01-09 16:29:38.000000', 0),
