(4379301, 627989, 79720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Rando D300:</b></div><hr/><i> David ,how did you get this angle of that shot ,tell me you did not climb that tree beside the river ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, no...I set my tripod on the wall. I might get a little more adventurous for the River challenge, though. <b>:-</b>P</td>', 'Originally posted by Rando D300: David ,how did you get this angle of that shot ,tell me you did not climb that tree beside the river ?   No, no...I set my tripod on the wall. I might get a little more adventurous for the River challenge, though. :-P', '2008-01-09 20:33:47.000000', NULL, 0),
