(4383065, 626265, 63398, '<td valign="top">I love the majestic isolation of this bird of prey as he sors past the falls. IMO this is a once-in-a-lifetime image and you were graced to have it be yours. Congrats on being the one to capture it, and trust that I will enjoy it for years to come. Thanks for sharing this marvelous image!</td>', 'I love the majestic isolation of this bird of prey as he sors past the falls. IMO this is a once-in-a-lifetime image and you were graced to have it be yours. Congrats on being the one to capture it, and trust that I will enjoy it for years to come. Thanks for sharing this marvelous image!', '2008-01-10 21:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
