(4383338, 625806, 50641, '<td valign="top">Very nice and that''s a perfect title.  I like how with the tones you chose, it almost looks bronzed.  I''m digging the dof.  I do think colorcarnival makes an interesting point - makes me wonder how this would look if the leaves were in color, keeping the bark the way it is.  In any case, well-seen!</td>', 'Very nice and that''s a perfect title.  I like how with the tones you chose, it almost looks bronzed.  I''m digging the dof.  I do think colorcarnival makes an interesting point - makes me wonder how this would look if the leaves were in color, keeping the bark the way it is.  In any case, well-seen!', '2008-01-10 22:46:48.000000', NULL, 0),
