(4383565, 620561, 74979, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> :)  !<br/> <br/>Well. . .that''s certainly one way to stay warm in the snow.<br/> <br/>Ok, Richard. ..show us some of your outtakes, because surely, you <i>did</i> capture some photos of these majestic animals in that breathtaking winter wonder-beauty when they were in an ummmmm more traditional pose ????     After you got the voyerurism out of your system that is :)   Suuuuurely you got some photos of them looking beautiful and "all-is-well-with-our-world" expressions ??????? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>um, I think Sandy would like to see some of the "<u>afterglow"</u> shots, Richard..like, say, did he offer her a cigarette??  :) still in my mind, and on repat (after repeat)look, a most excellent image.</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: :)  ! Well. . .that''s certainly one way to stay warm in the snow. Ok, Richard. ..show us some of your outtakes, because surely, you did capture some photos of these majestic animals in that breathtaking winter wonder-beauty when they were in an ummmmm more traditional pose ????     After you got the voyerurism out of your system that is :)   Suuuuurely you got some photos of them looking beautiful and "all-is-well-with-our-world" expressions ???????   um, I think Sandy would like to see some of the "afterglow" shots, Richard..like, say, did he offer her a cigarette??  :) still in my mind, and on repat (after repeat)look, a most excellent image.', '2008-01-11 00:14:56.000000', NULL, 0),
