(4388361, 621536, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cute!!  I love their smiles and their eyes could light up a room!  I will echo what a few have said - not sure if you''re using Neat Image or not - their faces are fine, but there''s something going on with their hair where it looks all kinda blended together.  If you''re willing, post the original and your processing steps in the TS thread and let some of the folks there take a shot at it and share tips.</td>', 'Very cute!!  I love their smiles and their eyes could light up a room!  I will echo what a few have said - not sure if you''re using Neat Image or not - their faces are fine, but there''s something going on with their hair where it looks all kinda blended together.  If you''re willing, post the original and your processing steps in the TS thread and let some of the folks there take a shot at it and share tips.', '2008-01-13 00:27:44.000000', NULL, 0),
