(4548622, 625638, 67145, '<td valign="top">bruce_the_robert eh?!!.. i wondered who you were with the comments on my words and visions, and so i had a look at your profile page .. ahha .. an old friend with a new name .. !!<br/>and this stunning photograph is a real treat for the eyes since i last visited your portfolio .. a most beautiful scene and captured so well .. and OMG .. 6.9375 in a free study ... AND 5th place ... CONGRATULATIONS CONGRATULATIONS ... must have been a very nice, slightly belated, christmas present ... :):)<br/></td>', 'bruce_the_robert eh?!!.. i wondered who you were with the comments on my words and visions, and so i had a look at your profile page .. ahha .. an old friend with a new name .. !!and this stunning photograph is a real treat for the eyes since i last visited your portfolio .. a most beautiful scene and captured so well .. and OMG .. 6.9375 in a free study ... AND 5th place ... CONGRATULATIONS CONGRATULATIONS ... must have been a very nice, slightly belated, christmas present ... :):)', '2008-03-08 16:05:32.000000', NULL, 0),
